{"project":{"indexOriginal":0,"gameEngine":"APPUI","files":{"/addons/VNTextPatch/vntextpatch.js":{"data":[["I have extracted the game data","我已提取游戏数据"],["Load game's data folder","加载游戏的数据文件夹"],["Select the game's data folder","选择游戏的数据文件夹"],["Engine Info","引擎信息"],["Currently detected engine","当前检测到的引擎"],["Manually Specify Format","手动指定格式"],["Manually specify the game format.<br />VNTranslationTools will automatically detect the format based on the file extension. However, if you encounter ambiguous file extensions, please provide the format explicitly.","手动指定游戏格式。<br />VNTranslationTools 会根据文件扩展名自动检测格式。但是，如果遇到模糊的文件扩展名，请明确提供格式。"],["Interface","界面"],["VNTextPatch can parse the game into two formats: JSON or an XLSX spreadsheet. Please select the interface you want to use.","VNTextPatch 可以将游戏解析为两种格式：JSON 或 XLSX 电子表格。请选择您要使用的界面。"],["Warning: There is a row limit if you're choosing XLSX spreadsheet.","警告：如果选择 XLSX 电子表格，存在行数限制。"],["Create a new project","创建新项目"],["Invalid destination directory:","无效的目标目录："],["Close","关闭"]],"context":[["tid/8164/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8228/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8233/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8246/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8251/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8256/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8261/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8266/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8271/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8276/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8455/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8516/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/11110/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"vntextpatch.js","dirname":"/addons/VNTextPatch","extension":".js","filename":"vntextpatch.js","path":"/addons/VNTextPatch/vntextpatch.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"I have extracted the game data":0,"Load game's data folder":1,"Select the game's data folder":2,"Engine Info":3,"Currently detected engine":4,"Manually Specify Format":5,"Manually specify the game format.<br />VNTranslationTools will automatically detect the format based on the file extension. However, if you encounter ambiguous file extensions, please provide the format explicitly.":6,"Interface":7,"VNTextPatch can parse the game into two formats: JSON or an XLSX spreadsheet. Please select the interface you want to use.":8,"Warning: There is a row limit if you're choosing XLSX spreadsheet.":9,"Create a new project":10,"Invalid destination directory:":11,"Close":12},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/actionEditorParser/ae4parser.js":{"data":[["Start translation from Action Editor 4 Game","从Action Editor 4 Game开始翻译"],["Create Project","创建项目"]],"context":[["tid/920/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/997/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ae4parser.js","dirname":"/addons/actionEditorParser","extension":".js","filename":"ae4parser.js","path":"/addons/actionEditorParser/ae4parser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start translation from Action Editor 4 Game":0,"Create Project":1},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/adminTools/!post.html":{"data":[["Actions","操作"],["Build for 32bit system","为32位系统构建"],["Build for non developer build too","也为非开发者构建"],["Custom Version","自定义版本"],["Custom version (leave blank to autogenerate version)","自定义版本（留空以自动生成版本）"],["Generate minor versioning?","生成次要版本？"],["Save patch to","保存补丁到"],["Destination folder of generated patch","生成补丁的目标文件夹"],["Overider template","覆盖模板"],["Release template","发布模板"],["Select file to be available live and excluded from the package","选择文件使其在线可用并从包中排除"],["The file will be excluded from package, but available online","该文件将从包中排除，但可在线上使用"],["Make the process does not require user input","使过程无需用户输入"],["Patch Type","补丁类型"],["The file will be excluded from package, but available online. Select the file you want to substitute.","该文件将从包中排除，但可在线上使用。选择您想要替换的文件。"],["Substitute trans.js with a fake one.","用虚假的trans.js替换"],["Select Patch File","选择补丁文件"],["Select the generated patch file (*.tpch).","选择生成的补丁文件 (*.tpch)。"],["Patches Links","补丁链接"],["Autoupdate will download from these links. <b>Must be direct download!</b> Separate each download link with newline.","自动更新将从这些链接下载。<b>必须是直接下载链接！</b> 每个下载链接用换行符分隔。"],["Download Links","下载链接"],["Downloadable package for manual download. Separate each download link with newline.","可供手动下载的软件包。每个下载链接用换行符分隔。"],["Release Category","发布类别"],["Category of the release.","发布的类别。"],["Upload log along with this submission.","随此提交上传日志。"],["Remove the same version found on database.","从数据库中移除找到的相同版本。"],["Whether this release is enabled or not.","此版本是否启用。"],["Whether this release is hidden or not. If a release is hidden. Only Administrators and member with <code>view_hidden_releases</code> (Developer) capability can install the release via package installer.","此版本是否隐藏。如果版本被隐藏，只有管理员和具有<code>view_hidden_releases</code>（开发者）权限的成员可以通过包安装器安装此版本。"],["Release Name","版本名称"],["Release Number","版本号"],["Release Date","发布日期"],["Release Key","版本密钥"],["Release Type","版本类型"],["CRC","CRC"],["Required Version","所需版本"],["Minimum Version","最低版本"],["Release Note","发布说明"],["Release Info","发布信息"],["On Before Install","安装前"],["On After Install","安装后"],["Extra parameters","额外参数"],["Remote file","远程文件"],["List of remote file, separate by new line","远程文件列表，用换行符分隔"],["Patron Level","赞助者等级"],["Post title","帖子标题"],["Release post","发布帖子"],["Excerpt of the post","帖子摘录"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText","idx/14/innerText","idx/29/innerText","idx/79/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText","idx/16/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText","idx/17/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText","idx/18/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText","idx/19/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText","idx/20/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText","idx/21/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText","idx/22/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText","idx/25/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText","idx/28/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/35/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/45/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"],["idx/49/innerText"],["idx/51/innerText"],["idx/53/innerText"],["idx/55/innerText"],["idx/57/innerText"],["idx/59/innerText"],["idx/61/innerText"],["idx/63/innerText"],["idx/65/innerText"],["idx/67/innerText"],["idx/69/innerText"],["idx/70/innerText"],["idx/71/innerText"],["idx/73/innerText"],["idx/75/innerText"],["idx/77/innerText"]],"basename":"!post.html","dirname":"/addons/adminTools","extension":".html","filename":"!post.html","path":"/addons/adminTools/!post.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Actions":0,"":1,"Build for 32bit system":1,"Build for non developer build too":2,"Custom Version":3,"Custom version (leave blank to autogenerate version)":4,"Generate minor versioning?":5,"Save patch to":6,"Destination folder of generated patch":7,"Overider template":8,"Release template":9,"Select file to be available live and excluded from the package":10,"The file will be excluded from package, but available online":11,"Make the process does not require user input":12,"Patch Type":13,"The file will be excluded from package, but available online. Select the file you want to substitute.":14,"Substitute trans.js with a fake one.":15,"Select Patch File":16,"Select the generated patch file (*.tpch).":17,"Patches Links":18,"Autoupdate will download from these links. <b>Must be direct download!</b> Separate each download link with newline.":19,"Download Links":20,"Downloadable package for manual download. Separate each download link with newline.":21,"Release Category":22,"Category of the release.":23,"Upload log along with this submission.":24,"Remove the same version found on database.":25,"Whether this release is enabled or not.":26,"Whether this release is hidden or not. If a release is hidden. Only Administrators and member with <code>view_hidden_releases</code> (Developer) capability can install the release via package installer.":27,"Release Name":28,"Release Number":29,"Release Date":30,"Release Key":31,"Release Type":32,"CRC":33,"Required Version":34,"Minimum Version":35,"Release Note":36,"Release Info":37,"On Before Install":38,"On After Install":39,"Extra parameters":40,"Remote file":41,"List of remote file, separate by new line":42,"Patron Level":43,"Post title":44,"Release post":45,"Excerpt of the post":46},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/adminTools/!postPackage.html":{"data":[["Select package json file","选择包JSON文件"],["Select the generated patch file","选择生成的补丁文件"],["Or Select Destination File","或选择目标文件"],["Or Download location","或下载位置"],["Icon","图标"],["Author","作者"],["Name","名称"],["name of the package.","包的名称"],["Title","标题"],["Title of the package.","包的标题"],["Version","版本"],["Version of the package.","包的版本。"],["Description","描述"],["Description of the package.","包的描述。"],["Whether this release is active or not.","此版本是否处于活动状态。"],["Whether this release is hidden or not.","此版本是否被隐藏。"],["Patron Level","赞助者等级"],["Current month's pledge in $","本月以美元计的赞助金额"],["Patron Points","赞助者点数"],["100pts = 1$","100点 = 1美元"],["Purchase type","购买类型"],["Type of the purchase.","购买类型。"],["On Before Install","安装前"],["Javascript code to be run before install","安装前要运行的Javascript代码"],["On After Install","安装后"],["Javascript code to be run after install","安装后要运行的Javascript代码"],["Manifest","清单"],["Manifest data","清单数据"],["Minimum version","最低版本"],["Minimum version of Translator++ to be able to insatall this addon.","能够安装此插件所需的Translator++最低版本。"],["Release Date","发布日期"],["Is parser changed?","解析器是否已更改？"],["Mark as parser change. Would warn the user to backup their project before updating to this addon.","标记为解析器更改。会警告用户在更新此插件前备份项目。"],["Remove the same version found on database.","从数据库中移除找到的相同版本。"],["Excluded files","排除的文件"],["Files listed here will be excluded from the distribution packages","此处列出的文件将从分发包中排除"],["Script URL","脚本URL"],["Script of the URL.","URL的脚本。"],["Upload script","上传脚本"],["This script will be uploaded to the back-end and will be processed with [php]Scripts template script.\n\t\t\t\t\tTo use this feature:\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Create a wordpress page with <b>[php]Scripts template</b> template.<br>You can also set the patreon's requirement to view the post.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Add the url to the page into the package.json file with <b>l</b> GET parameter point to the local file.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFor example : <u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t","此脚本将上传到后端，并使用[php]脚本模板脚本进行处理。\n\t\t\t\t\t要使用此功能：\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>创建一个WordPress页面，使用<b>[php]脚本模板</b>模板。<br>您还可以设置Patreon要求以查看帖子。</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>在package.json文件中添加页面URL，使用<b>l</b> GET参数指向本地文件。<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t例如：<u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t"],["Actions","操作"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText","idx/3/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/25/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/28/innerText"],["idx/29/innerText"],["idx/30/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/44/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"]],"basename":"!postPackage.html","dirname":"/addons/adminTools","extension":".html","filename":"!postPackage.html","path":"/addons/adminTools/!postPackage.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select package json file":0,"Select the generated patch file":1,"Or Select Destination File":2,"Or Download location":3,"":4,"Icon":4,"Author":5,"Name":6,"name of the package.":7,"Title":8,"Title of the package.":9,"Version":10,"Version of the package.":11,"Description":12,"Description of the package.":13,"Whether this release is active or not.":14,"Whether this release is hidden or not.":15,"Patron Level":16,"Current month's pledge in $":17,"Patron Points":18,"100pts = 1$":19,"Purchase type":20,"Type of the purchase.":21,"On Before Install":22,"Javascript code to be run before install":23,"On After Install":24,"Javascript code to be run after install":25,"Manifest":26,"Manifest data":27,"Minimum version":28,"Minimum version of Translator++ to be able to insatall this addon.":29,"Release Date":30,"Is parser changed?":31,"Mark as parser change. Would warn the user to backup their project before updating to this addon.":32,"Remove the same version found on database.":33,"Excluded files":34,"Files listed here will be excluded from the distribution packages":35,"Script URL":36,"Script of the URL.":37,"Upload script":38,"This script will be uploaded to the back-end and will be processed with [php]Scripts template script.\n\t\t\t\t\tTo use this feature:\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Create a wordpress page with <b>[php]Scripts template</b> template.<br>You can also set the patreon's requirement to view the post.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Add the url to the page into the package.json file with <b>l</b> GET parameter point to the local file.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFor example : <u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t":39,"Actions":40},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/adminTools/adminTools.js":{"data":[["Close","关闭"]],"context":[["tid/588/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"adminTools.js","dirname":"/addons/adminTools","extension":".js","filename":"adminTools.js","path":"/addons/adminTools/adminTools.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Close":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/aec/aec.js":{"data":[["Universal Archive Unpacker","通用存档解包器"]],"context":[["tid/1001/type/StringLiteral","tid/1239/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"aec.js","dirname":"/addons/aec","extension":".js","filename":"aec.js","path":"/addons/aec/aec.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Universal Archive Unpacker":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-proxy.js":{"data":[["Extract a Bakin game dictionary from data.rbpack, translate dic.txt, and patch the player automatically.","从data.rbpack中提取Bakin游戏词典，翻译dic.txt，并自动打补丁到播放器。"],["Create project","创建项目"],["Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!","错误：customField未定义。这不应该发生！"],["Please select the Bakin game executable.","请选择Bakin游戏可执行文件。"],["<h2>Proxy workflow</h2>","<h2>代理工作流程</h2>"],["Translator++ unpacks data.rbpack into a temporary folder.","Translator++将data.rbpack解包到临时文件夹中。"],["Split Dictionary uses dump-split and creates one .txt file per source area by default.","拆分词典默认使用dump-split，并按源区域创建一个.txt文件。"],["Merge Dictionary uses a single dic.txt.","合并词典使用单个dic.txt。"],["Injection merges split dictionaries back into data/dic.txt and patches the player executable.","注入将拆分后的词典合并回data/dic.txt，并打补丁到播放器可执行文件。"],["Split Dictionary (default)","拆分字典（默认）"],["Merge Dictionary","合并字典"]],"context":[["tid/2860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2929/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2966/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3002/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3253/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3266/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3277/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3288/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3299/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3383/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3393/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"bakin-proxy.js","dirname":"/addons/bakinParser","extension":".js","filename":"bakin-proxy.js","path":"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-proxy.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Extract a Bakin game dictionary from data.rbpack, translate dic.txt, and patch the player automatically.":0,"Create project":1,"Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!":2,"Please select the Bakin game executable.":3,"<h2>Proxy workflow</h2>":4,"Translator++ unpacks data.rbpack into a temporary folder.":5,"Split Dictionary uses dump-split and creates one .txt file per source area by default.":6,"Merge Dictionary uses a single dic.txt.":7,"Injection merges split dictionaries back into data/dic.txt and patches the player executable.":8,"Split Dictionary (default)":9,"Merge Dictionary":10},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-xlsx.js":{"data":[["Start a translation project from RPG Developer Bakin localization sheet (xlsx).","从RPG Developer Bakin本地化表格（xlsx）启动翻译项目。"],["Create project","创建项目"],["Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!","错误：customField未定义。这不应该发生！"],["Please select the entry point to translate.","请选择翻译的入口点。"],["<h2>RPG Developer Bakin editor is required</h2>","<h2>需要RPG Developer Bakin编辑器</h2>"],["RPG Developer Bakin editor is required to start the translation project.","启动翻译项目需要RPG Developer Bakin编辑器。"],["<h2>Before you start</h2>","<h2>开始前</h2>"],["<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">Unpack your game</a> into editable RPG Developer Bakin's project.","<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">解包您的游戏</a>为可编辑的RPG Developer Bakin项目。"],["Export the localization strings by using RPG Developer Bakin application into a xlsx file. <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">See the guide here on how to translate Bakin game</a>.","使用RPG Developer Bakin应用程序将本地化字符串导出为xlsx文件。<a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">查看此处关于如何翻译Bakin游戏的指南</a>。"]],"context":[["tid/614/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/683/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/720/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/756/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1034/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1041/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1064/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1077/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1088/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"bakin-xlsx.js","dirname":"/addons/bakinParser","extension":".js","filename":"bakin-xlsx.js","path":"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-xlsx.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start a translation project from RPG Developer Bakin localization sheet (xlsx).":0,"Create project":1,"Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!":2,"Please select the entry point to translate.":3,"<h2>RPG Developer Bakin editor is required</h2>":4,"RPG Developer Bakin editor is required to start the translation project.":5,"<h2>Before you start</h2>":6,"<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">Unpack your game</a> into editable RPG Developer Bakin's project.":7,"Export the localization strings by using RPG Developer Bakin application into a xlsx file. <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">See the guide here on how to translate Bakin game</a>.":8},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/basicUtils.js":{"data":[["NWJS Version","NWJS 版本"],["Change into this NWJS version","切换到此 NWJS 版本"],["Use Developer version","使用开发者版本"],["Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.","使用 NWJS 开发者版本。开发者版本提供开发者工具。适合调试和开发。"],["In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.","在开发者版本中，您可以使用 <b>开发者控制台</b>。按 F12 或右键点击应用并选择“检查”即可访问开发者控制台。"],["Use 32-bit version","使用 32 位版本"],["Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).","使用 NWJS 的 32 位版本。32 位版本有助于与旧系统兼容。如果可能，建议取消勾选此选项（只需升级您的机器，伙计）。"],["Some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version","某些 Translator++ 功能可能在不同 NWJS 版本间不兼容"],["Please be aware that some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version. Make sure to test your project after changing the NWJS version.","请注意，某些 Translator++ 功能可能在不同 NWJS 版本间不兼容。更改 NWJS 版本后，请务必测试您的项目。"],["You're currently running on NWJS ver.","您当前运行的 NWJS 版本为。"],["Change Translator++ Core NWJS version","更改 Translator++ 核心 NWJS 版本"],["You're already using the selected NWJS version.","您已在使用选定的 NWJS 版本。"],["This operation will close Translator++ and change the current NW.js version into","此操作将关闭 Translator++ 并将当前 NW.js 版本更改为"],["If you have any unsaved changes, please select 'Cancel' and save your project first.\nDo you want to continue?","如果您有任何未保存的更改，请选择“取消”并先保存您的项目。\n您要继续吗？"]],"context":[["tid/1342/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1352/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1428/type/StringLiteral","tid/1617/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1438/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1449/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1482/type/StringLiteral","tid/1641/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1492/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1532/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1537/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1669/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1745/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1769/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1782/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"basicUtils.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils","extension":".js","filename":"basicUtils.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/basicUtils.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"NWJS Version":0,"Change into this NWJS version":1,"Use Developer version":2,"Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.":3,"In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.":4,"Use 32-bit version":5,"Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).":6,"Some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version":7,"Please be aware that some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version. Make sure to test your project after changing the NWJS version.":8,"You're currently running on NWJS ver.":9,"Change Translator++ Core NWJS version":10,"You're already using the selected NWJS version.":11,"This operation will close Translator++ and change the current NW.js version into":12,"If you have any unsaved changes, please select 'Cancel' and save your project first.\nDo you want to continue?":13},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/mainMenu.js":{"data":[["Change Language","更改语言"],["No MTL available for this language pair","此语言对无可用的 MTL"],["Change default MTL for this project","更改此项目的默认 MTL"],["???","???"],["Search in a folder","在文件夹中搜索"],["Search in Staging Files","在暂存文件中搜索"],["Search in Original Files","在原始文件中搜索"],["No original files path is set for this project.","此项目未设置原始文件路径。"],["Search in Translated Files","在翻译文件中搜索"],["No translated files path is set for this project.\nYou need to inject your translation once to set the translated files path.","此项目未设置翻译文件路径。\n您需要注入一次翻译以设置翻译文件路径。"],["Chat with AI Assistant","与AI助手聊天"],["AI Assistant is not available since the new features are not loaded.\nPlease reinstall or re-update Translator++.","AI助手不可用，因为新功能未加载。\n请重新安装或重新更新Translator++。"]],"context":[["tid/442/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/729/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/974/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1182/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1339/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1404/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1501/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1539/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1624/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1662/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1777/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1812/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"mainMenu.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils","extension":".js","filename":"mainMenu.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/mainMenu.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Change Language":0,"No MTL available for this language pair":1,"Change default MTL for this project":2,"???":3,"Search in a folder":4,"Search in Staging Files":5,"Search in Original Files":6,"No original files path is set for this project.":7,"Search in Translated Files":8,"No translated files path is set for this project.\nYou need to inject your translation once to set the translated files path.":9,"Chat with AI Assistant":10,"AI Assistant is not available since the new features are not loaded.\nPlease reinstall or re-update Translator++.":11},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/HTMLPacker.js":{"data":[["Path is not a file:","路径并没有指向文件:"],["Icon path is not a file:","图标路径不是文件："],["Path is not an exe file:","路径不是可执行文件："],["Icon path is not an ico file:","图标路径不是ico文件："],["Html entry point","HTML入口点"],["Select the html entry point file (usually index.html)","选择HTML入口点文件（通常是index.html）"],["Destination folder","目标文件夹"],["Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.","选择目标文件夹。此过程将替换现有文件。"],["NWJS version","NWJS版本"],["Optional. Select NWJS version and architecture.<br />Latest version not always better, just use what works for you.","可选。选择NWJS版本和架构。<br />最新版本不一定更好，只需使用适合您的版本。"],["Application ID","应用程序ID"],["Set the application ID for the game. The ID must be in lowercase and can only contain letters, numbers, and underscores.","设置游戏的应用程序ID。ID必须为小写，且只能包含字母、数字和下划线。"],["Application description","应用程序描述"],["Set the application description for the game.","设置游戏的应用程序描述。"],["Window title","窗口标题"],["Set the default window title for the game.<br />This value may be overridden by the game engine.","设置游戏的默认窗口标题。<br />此值可能被游戏引擎覆盖。"],["Window width","窗口宽度"],["Set the default window width for the game.","设置游戏的默认窗口宽度。"],["Window height","窗口高度"],["Set the default window height for the game.","设置游戏的默认窗口高度。"],["Full screen","全屏"],["Set the game to start in full screen mode.","设置游戏以全屏模式启动。"],["Resizable","可调整大小"],["Set the game window to be resizable.","设置游戏窗口为可调整大小。"],["Game icon","游戏图标"],["Select the icon file for the game executable. The icon file must be in .ico format. The icon will be embedded in the game executable.","选择游戏可执行文件的图标文件。图标文件必须是.ico格式。图标将被嵌入到游戏可执行文件中。"],["Through this form, you can create a playable package of your game. <br />The process will replace the existing files in the destination folder.","通过此表单，您可以创建游戏的可玩包。<br />此过程将替换目标文件夹中的现有文件。"],["Start the application in full screen mode","以全屏模式启动应用程序"],["Allow the application to be resizable","允许应用程序可调整大小"],["HTML Compiler","HTML编译器"],["Compile","编译"],["Source path can not empty","文件路径不可为空"],["Destination path can not empty","目标路径不能为空"]],"context":[["tid/86/type/StringLiteral","tid/4136/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/116/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/186/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2424/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2434/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2474/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2484/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2524/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2534/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2587/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2597/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2631/type/StringLiteral","tid/3795/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2641/type/StringLiteral","tid/3805/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2675/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2722/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2766/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2776/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2810/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2820/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2854/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2864/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2899/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2909/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2950/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3900/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3924/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4020/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4037/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4083/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4104/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"HTMLPacker.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"HTMLPacker.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/HTMLPacker.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Path is not a file:":0,"Icon path is not a file:":1,"Path is not an exe file:":2,"Icon path is not an ico file:":3,"Html entry point":4,"Select the html entry point file (usually index.html)":5,"Destination folder":6,"Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.":7,"NWJS version":8,"Optional. Select NWJS version and architecture.<br />Latest version not always better, just use what works for you.":9,"Application ID":10,"Set the application ID for the game. The ID must be in lowercase and can only contain letters, numbers, and underscores.":11,"Application description":12,"Set the application description for the game.":13,"Window title":14,"Set the default window title for the game.<br />This value may be overridden by the game engine.":15,"Window width":16,"Set the default window width for the game.":17,"Window height":18,"Set the default window height for the game.":19,"Full screen":20,"Set the game to start in full screen mode.":21,"Resizable":22,"Set the game window to be resizable.":23,"Game icon":24,"Select the icon file for the game executable. The icon file must be in .ico format. The icon will be embedded in the game executable.":25,"Through this form, you can create a playable package of your game. <br />The process will replace the existing files in the destination folder.":26,"Start the application in full screen mode":27,"Allow the application to be resizable":28,"HTML Compiler":29,"Compile":30,"Source path can not empty":31,"Destination path can not empty":32},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/Updater.js":{"data":[["An update is being installed. Please do not close the application until the installation is completed.","正在安装更新。在安装完成之前，请勿关闭应用程序。"],["Package Path","补丁文件路径"],["Select the package file.","选择补丁文件"],["Package Key","包密钥"],["If you have the key, please enter it here. If not, leave it empty.","如果您有密钥，请在此处输入。如果没有，请留空。"],["Through this form, you can update Translator++ with the updater package file. You can download the updater package <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>here</a>.","通过此表单，您可以使用更新包文件更新 Translator++。您可以<a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>在此处</a>下载更新包。"],["Update from package","从更新补丁安装"],["Update","更新"],["Update Translator++","更新Translator++"]],"context":[["tid/4918/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6562/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6572/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6612/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6622/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6661/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6753/type/StringLiteral","tid/7195/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6770/type/StringLiteral","tid/7091/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7120/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"Updater.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"Updater.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/Updater.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"An update is being installed. Please do not close the application until the installation is completed.":0,"Package Path":1,"Select the package file.":2,"Package Key":3,"If you have the key, please enter it here. If not, leave it empty.":4,"Through this form, you can update Translator++ with the updater package file. You can download the updater package <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>here</a>.":5,"Update from package":6,"Update":7,"Update Translator++":8},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/info.js":{"data":[["You have ","您有 "],[" missed update(s)!"," 个更新未安装！"],["Translator++ will update itself if auto-update is enabled.","如果启用了自动更新，Translator++ 将自动更新。"],["You can download the latest core version of Translator++ at","您可以在以下位置下载 Translator++ 的最新核心版本："],["This update is available for all patrons.","此更新适用于所有赞助者。"],["This update is available for tier $","此更新适用于 $"],[" patrons or greater."," 等级或更高的赞助者。"],["You're up-to-date!","您已是最新版本！"],["Thanks for staying up to date with Translator++! You're on the newest version, and we appreciate your support. Enjoy translating!","感谢您保持 Translator++ 的最新状态！您使用的是最新版本，我们感谢您的支持。祝您翻译愉快！"],["Some update information may be shown from cache. You can click <b>'Check for update'</b> to load the latest version details.","部分更新信息可能从缓存中显示。您可以点击<b>'检查更新'</b>来加载最新版本详情。"],["When the same version is available","当相同版本可用时"],["Allow Translator++ to reinstall the same version of Translator++.","允许Translator++重新安装相同版本的Translator++。"],["Allow reinstall the same version","允许更新到相同版本"],["Update Settings","更新设置"],["Update Now","立即更新"],["Updater is not available, please update Translator++ manually.","更新失败，请手动更新Translator++."],["Updating Translator++","正在更新Translator++"],["Please don't close Translator++ until the update process is finished.","更新过程完成前，请不要关闭Translator++。"],["Can not update, reason :\n","无法更新, 原因 :\n"],["You may need to reconnect Translator++ with your Patreon account (logout and login again).","你可能需要在Translator++中重新登录Patreon账号 (注销然后重新登录)."],["Also, it has been reported that some countries such as mainland China are blocking dropbox repository.","根据反馈，中国地区的防火墙也会阻止软件自动更新."],["If for some reason you cannot access our repository, please manually download the update package (tpch file) using a proxy or VPN here:","如果您因为某些原因无法访问我们的服务器, 请使用代理VPN或在此手动下载更新包 (.tpch 文件) :"],["After that, please use the \"Update from package\" feature to update your Translator++.","下载完成之后，请选择 \"从补丁包更新\" 来更新您的Translator++."],["If you still have problems, please contact us at our Discord server : ","如果问题仍然存在，请访问我们的Discord服务器："],["Restart","重启"],["Do you want to restart Translator++ now?\nIf you have unsaved work, cancel this dialog and save your work first.","您想现在重启Translator++吗？\n如果您有未保存的工作，请取消此对话框并先保存您的工作。"],["Check for Update","检查更新"],["Close","关闭"]],"context":[["tid/649/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/660/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/665/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/670/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1033/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1077/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1088/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1665/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1670/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1675/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1755/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1765/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1811/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1873/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2021/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2066/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2116/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2130/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2176/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2192/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2206/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2220/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2245/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2259/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2357/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2377/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2449/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2512/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"info.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"info.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/info.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"You have ":0," missed update(s)!":1,"Translator++ will update itself if auto-update is enabled.":2,"You can download the latest core version of Translator++ at":3,"This update is available for all patrons.":4,"This update is available for tier $":5," patrons or greater.":6,"You're up-to-date!":7,"Thanks for staying up to date with Translator++! You're on the newest version, and we appreciate your support. Enjoy translating!":8,"Some update information may be shown from cache. You can click <b>'Check for update'</b> to load the latest version details.":9,"When the same version is available":10,"Allow Translator++ to reinstall the same version of Translator++.":11,"Allow reinstall the same version":12,"Update Settings":13,"Update Now":14,"Updater is not available, please update Translator++ manually.":15,"Updating Translator++":16,"Please don't close Translator++ until the update process is finished.":17,"Can not update, reason :\n":18,"You may need to reconnect Translator++ with your Patreon account (logout and login again).":19,"Also, it has been reported that some countries such as mainland China are blocking dropbox repository.":20,"If for some reason you cannot access our repository, please manually download the update package (tpch file) using a proxy or VPN here:":21,"After that, please use the \"Update from package\" feature to update your Translator++.":22,"If you still have problems, please contact us at our Discord server : ":23,"Restart":24,"Do you want to restart Translator++ now?\nIf you have unsaved work, cancel this dialog and save your work first.":25,"Check for Update":26,"Close":27},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/uiTags.js":{"data":[["Do not process row with selected tag (blacklist)","不处理带有选定标签的行（黑名单）"],["Only process row with selected tag (whitelist)","仅处理带有选定标签的行（白名单）"],["Ignore tag","忽略标签"],["Load last selection","加载上次选择项"],["Reset","重置"],["Cancel","取消"],["Confirm","确认"]],"context":[["tid/55/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/60/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/65/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/410/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/415/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2085/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2137/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"uiTags.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"uiTags.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/uiTags.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Do not process row with selected tag (blacklist)":0,"Only process row with selected tag (whitelist)":1,"Ignore tag":2,"Load last selection":3,"Reset":4,"Cancel":5,"Confirm":6},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/CustomParserLoader.js":{"data":[["List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. Separate each value with a comma.<br />Translator++ will read the original file with the following encodings, patch the files and write with the <b>Write Character encoding</b> option. Leave blank to use the original character encoding when the project is created.","可能的字符编码列表。<b>顺序很重要！</b>用逗号分隔每个值。<br />Translator++将使用以下编码读取原始文件，修补文件并使用<b>写入字符编码</b>选项写入。留空以使用项目创建时的原始字符编码。"],["For BOM support, add a space after the encoding. Example: <code>utf8 bom</code>","对于BOM支持，请在编码后添加空格。示例：<code>utf8 bom</code>"],["Example: utf8,utf8 bom,utf16le,ascii","示例：utf8、utf8 bom、utf16le、ascii"],["Select the target character encoding.","选择目标字符编码。"]],"context":[["tid/3375/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3383/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3392/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4740/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"CustomParserLoader.js","dirname":"/addons/customParser","extension":".js","filename":"CustomParserLoader.js","path":"/addons/customParser/CustomParserLoader.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. Separate each value with a comma.<br />Translator++ will read the original file with the following encodings, patch the files and write with the <b>Write Character encoding</b> option. Leave blank to use the original character encoding when the project is created.":0,"For BOM support, add a space after the encoding. Example: <code>utf8 bom</code>":1,"Example: utf8,utf8 bom,utf16le,ascii":2,"Select the target character encoding.":3},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.html":{"data":[["<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>","<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>"],["<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Add a new file group</label>","<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">添加新文件组</label>"],["Add a new file group","添加新文件组"],["<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Remove current file group</label>","<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">移除当前文件组</label>"],["Remove current file group","移除当前文件组"],["Rules","规则"],["Hooks","钩子"],["Options","选项"],["Testing","测试"],["Interpolate the strings before being displayed on the cells. <b>To Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>From Grid</b>","在单元格显示前对字符串进行插值。<b>到网格</b>是<b>从网格</b>的反义词"],["Example","示例"],["For example, the text obtained from the parser is as follows:","例如，从解析器获取的文本如下："],["In this grid it will look like this:","在此网格中，它将显示为："],["That's not the easiest text to work with.<br>\n  We can fix that by declaring <span class=\"inlineCode\">To Grid hooks</span> as follows:\n","这不是最容易处理的文本。<br>\n  我们可以通过如下声明 <span class=\"inlineCode\">To Grid 钩子</span> 来修复：\n"],["With the hook above the text in the grid will be :","使用上述钩子，网格中的文本将变为："],["Interpolate the strings from the cells into the translation result. <b>From Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>To Grid</b>.","将单元格中的字符串插值到翻译结果中。<b>From Grid</b> 是 <b>To Grid</b> 的反义词。"],["\n  For example, the expected translated strings should be in JSON format.<br>\n  But writing translation in JSON format is not realy the easiest thing to do. <br>\n  So, instead of asking our translator to translate in JSON format, we can just ask them to type normally, and add a <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> as follows:\n","\n  例如，预期的翻译字符串应为 JSON 格式。<br>\n  但用 JSON 格式编写翻译确实不是最简单的事情。<br>\n  因此，与其要求翻译人员以 JSON 格式翻译，我们可以只要求他们正常输入，并添加一个 <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid 钩子</span> 如下：\n"],["\n  With the <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> above, the following translation ...\n","\n  使用上面的 <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid 钩子</span>，以下翻译...\n"],["...will be converted into desired format: ","...将被转换为所需格式："],["Edit the translated text just before writing it into a file.","在将翻译文本写入文件之前进行编辑。"],["Parameters","参数"],["\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">text</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that is about to be written into a file.</p>\n            ","\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">文本</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">即将写入文件的文本。</p>\n            "],["text","文本"],["The text that is about to be written into a file.","即将写入文件的文本。"],["Return value","返回值"],["\n              <h3><i>String</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that will be written into a file.</p>\n            ","\n              <h3><i>字符串</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">将写入文件的文本。</p>\n            "],["The text that will be written into a file.","将写入文件的文本。"],["General","通用"],["Read character encoding","读取字符编码"],["Force parser to use the following character encoding when reading the file(s).","强制解析器在读取文件时使用以下字符编码。"],["Write character encoding","写入字符编码"],["Force parser to use the following character encoding when writing the file(s).","强制解析器在写入文件时使用以下字符编码。"],["You are editing:","您正在编辑："],["Please select the mode of your pattern","请选择您的模式"],["Regular expression Pattern","正则表达式模式"],["A valid ECMA Script's regular expression along with the modifier.<br>You can use <a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a> to create and test your pattern.","一个有效的ECMA Script正则表达式及其修饰符。<br>您可以使用<a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a>来创建和测试您的模式。"],["Pay attention to the use of carriage return (\\r) in the text to be translated. regex101.com will strip out the carriage returns so your pattern may have a different effect than what you see on regex101. ","注意待翻译文本中回车符（\\r）的使用。regex101.com会去除回车符，因此您的模式可能产生与regex101上所见不同的效果。"],["<strong>About quantifier that captures a zero length string.</strong><br>\n            <i>Null</i> strings will cause problems for the parser. Therefore, instead of using the <strong>*</strong> quantifier which will also capture <i>nulls</i>, it is highly recommended to use the <strong>+</strong> quantifier which will only capture strings if exist.","<strong>关于捕获零长度字符串的量词。</strong><br>\n            <i>空</i>字符串会导致解析器出现问题。因此，强烈建议使用<strong>+</strong>量词（仅当字符串存在时捕获），而不是使用<strong>*</strong>量词（也会捕获<i>空</i>值）。"],["Translatable Capture groups","可翻译捕获组"],["Index of the regular expression's groups (Integer) for the translatable texts. Can be more than one. Separate with comma.","正则表达式组（整数）的索引，用于可翻译文本。可以不止一个，用逗号分隔。"],["Row Info Capture group","行信息捕获组"],["\n            Index of the regular expression's group (Integer) for the row info (e.g. character name). <b>Only one group</b> is allowed. <br>\n            The value of the Row info can be carried over to the child rules and will be overwritten by the child rule's Row info value if exist.\n          ","\n            正则表达式组（整数）的索引，用于行信息（例如角色名称）。<b>仅允许一个组</b>。<br>\n            行信息的值可以传递到子规则中，如果存在，将被子规则的行信息值覆盖。\n          "],["Context template","上下文模板"],["\n            Context is unique identifier for translatable texts. <br>\n            You can use Javascript's template literals to add information to the context.<br>\n            <b>Available variable:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GROUP[<i>n</i>]</span> - Group capture.</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">RULE_ID</span> - The ID of the rule.</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>Example:</b>\n            <pre>item/${GROUP[2]}</pre>\n          ","\n            上下文是可翻译文本的唯一标识符。<br>\n            您可以使用JavaScript的模板字面量向上下文添加信息。<br>\n            <b>可用变量：</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GROUP[<i>n</i>]</span> - 组捕获。</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">RULE_ID</span> - 规则的ID。</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>示例：</b>\n            <pre>item/${GROUP[2]}</pre>\n          "],["Action","操作"],["Capture value","捕获值"],["Capture then mask value","捕获并屏蔽值"],["Mask value","屏蔽值"],["Send to inner rule","发送到内部规则"],["Edit inner rule <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>","编辑内部规则 <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>"],["What action the pattern is going to do.","模式将要执行的操作。"],["Javascript function","JavaScript函数"],["Guide","指南"],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Arguments</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>text</h3>\n              <p><b>String</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">A string of the entire content of the file.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>thisModel</h3>\n              <p><b>Object</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The rule object that is currently used by the file.</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\"><i>this</i> Keyword</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.</p>\n\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">参数</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">您编写的代码将位于一个函数内，该函数有2个参数，可在代码中任何位置访问：</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>text</h3>\n              <p><b>字符串</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">文件全部内容的字符串。</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>thisModel</h3>\n              <p><b>对象</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">当前文件使用的规则对象。</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\"><i>this</i> 关键字</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b> 将引用CustomParser类的实例。</p>\n\n        "],["Arguments","参数"],["The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:","您编写的代码将位于一个函数内，该函数有2个参数，可在代码中任何位置访问："],["A string of the entire content of the file.","文件全部内容的字符串。"],["The rule object that is currently used by the file.","当前文件使用的规则对象。"],["<i>this</i> Keyword","<i>this</i> 关键字"],["<b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.","<b>this</b> 将引用CustomParser类的实例。"],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Expected Return Value</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>undefined</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">预期返回值</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">您的代码必须<b>返回</b>以下值之一：</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>undefined</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">捕获文本的偏移量，例如：\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"角色名称\", // 角色名称，可选\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // 上下文，可选\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">捕获文本偏移量的数组，例如：\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"角色名称\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"另一个角色\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"第三个角色\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        "],["Expected Return Value","预期返回值"],["Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:","您的代码必须<b>返回</b>以下值之一："],["Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            ","捕获文本的偏移量，例如：\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"角色名称\", // 角色名称。可选\n    context: [\"一些\", \"上下文\", \"这里\"] // 上下文。可选\n  }\n</pre>\n            "],["Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            ","捕获文本偏移量的数组，例如：\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"角色名称\", context: [\"一些\", \"上下文\", \"这里\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"另一个角色\", context: [\"另一个\", \"上下文\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"第三个角色\", context: [\"第三个\", \"上下文\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            "],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Example</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++ is using regexp-match-indices\n  by that all RegExp.exec() method will return their group offset\n  read more about Regular Expression Indices here: https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar result \t\t\t= [];\nvar captureGroup \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (matches=regex.exec(text))) {\n  console.log(matches);\n  if (!matches?.indices?.[captureGroup]) continue;\n  result.push({\n    start\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][0],\n    end\t\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][1]\n  })\n}\nreturn result;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">示例</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">以下代码是解析srt字幕的示例。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++ 使用 regexp-match-indices\n  因此所有 RegExp.exec() 方法都会返回其组的偏移量\n  有关正则表达式索引的更多信息，请参见：https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar result \t\t\t= [];\nvar captureGroup \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (matches=regex.exec(text))) {\n  console.log(matches);\n  if (!matches?.indices?.[captureGroup]) continue;\n  result.push({\n    start\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][0],\n    end\t\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][1]\n  })\n}\nreturn result;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        "],["The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.","以下代码是解析srt字幕的示例。"],["Welcome to the Custom Parser Model Creator","欢迎使用自定义解析器模型创建器"],["Please start by creating a new File Group.","请先创建一个新的文件组。"],["Please define what kind of file you want to parse by clicking\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>Add a new file group</button> button.\n    ","请通过点击\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>添加新文件组</button> 按钮来定义您想要解析的文件类型。\n    "],["Press F1 to open the help dialog.","按F1打开帮助对话框。"],["New File","新建文件"],["Open file","打开文件"],["Save file","保存"],["Save As","另存为"],["Open debugger (F12)","打开调试器 (F12)"],["Help","帮助"],["Edit current file pattern","编辑当前文件模式"],["Add a new file pattern","添加新文件模式"],["Remove current file pattern","移除当前文件模式"],["Rule's order does matter, especially when you use masking! Drag to reorder.","规则顺序很重要，特别是使用掩码时！拖拽以重新排序。"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText","idx/29/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText","idx/16/innerText","idx/28/innerText","idx/69/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/25/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/30/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/35/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/44/innerText"],["idx/45/innerText"],["idx/46/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"],["idx/48/innerText"],["idx/49/innerText"],["idx/50/innerText"],["idx/51/innerText"],["idx/52/innerText"],["idx/53/innerText"],["idx/54/innerText"],["idx/55/innerText"],["idx/56/innerText"],["idx/57/innerText"],["idx/58/innerText"],["idx/59/innerText"],["idx/60/innerText"],["idx/61/innerText"],["idx/62/innerText"],["idx/63/innerText"],["idx/64/innerText"],["idx/65/innerText"],["idx/66/innerText"],["idx/67/innerText"],["idx/68/innerText"],["idx/70/innerText"],["idx/71/innerText"],["idx/72/innerText"],["idx/73/innerText"],["idx/74/innerText"],["idx/0/attr/title"],["idx/1/attr/title"],["idx/2/attr/title"],["idx/3/attr/title"],["idx/4/attr/title"],["idx/5/attr/title"],["idx/6/attr/title"],["idx/7/attr/title"],["idx/8/attr/title"],["idx/9/attr/title"]],"basename":"modelEditor.html","dirname":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor","extension":".html","filename":"modelEditor.html","path":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>":0,"<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Add a new file group</label>":1,"Add a new file group":2,"<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Remove current file group</label>":3,"Remove current file group":4,"Rules":5,"Hooks":6,"Options":7,"Testing":8,"Interpolate the strings before being displayed on the cells. <b>To Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>From Grid</b>":9,"Example":10,"For example, the text obtained from the parser is as follows:":11,"In this grid it will look like this:":12,"That's not the easiest text to work with.<br>\n  We can fix that by declaring <span class=\"inlineCode\">To Grid hooks</span> as follows:\n":13,"With the hook above the text in the grid will be :":14,"Interpolate the strings from the cells into the translation result. <b>From Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>To Grid</b>.":15,"\n  For example, the expected translated strings should be in JSON format.<br>\n  But writing translation in JSON format is not realy the easiest thing to do. <br>\n  So, instead of asking our translator to translate in JSON format, we can just ask them to type normally, and add a <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> as follows:\n":16,"\n  With the <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> above, the following translation ...\n":17,"...will be converted into desired format: ":18,"Edit the translated text just before writing it into a file.":19,"Parameters":20,"\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">text</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that is about to be written into a file.</p>\n            ":21,"text":22,"The text that is about to be written into a file.":23,"Return value":24,"\n              <h3><i>String</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that will be written into a file.</p>\n            ":25,"The text that will be written into a file.":26,"General":27,"Read character encoding":28,"Force parser to use the following character encoding when reading the file(s).":29,"Write character encoding":30,"Force parser to use the following character encoding when writing the file(s).":31,"You are editing:":32,"Please select the mode of your pattern":33,"Regular expression Pattern":34,"A valid ECMA Script's regular expression along with the modifier.<br>You can use <a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a> to create and test your pattern.":35,"Pay attention to the use of carriage return (\\r) in the text to be translated. regex101.com will strip out the carriage returns so your pattern may have a different effect than what you see on regex101. ":36,"<strong>About quantifier that captures a zero length string.</strong><br>\n            <i>Null</i> strings will cause problems for the parser. Therefore, instead of using the <strong>*</strong> quantifier which will also capture <i>nulls</i>, it is highly recommended to use the <strong>+</strong> quantifier which will only capture strings if exist.":37,"Translatable Capture groups":38,"Index of the regular expression's groups (Integer) for the translatable texts. Can be more than one. Separate with comma.":39,"Row Info Capture group":40,"\n            Index of the regular expression's group (Integer) for the row info (e.g. character name). <b>Only one group</b> is allowed. <br>\n            The value of the Row info can be carried over to the child rules and will be overwritten by the child rule's Row info value if exist.\n          ":41,"Context template":42,"\n            Context is unique identifier for translatable texts. <br>\n            You can use Javascript's template literals to add information to the context.<br>\n            <b>Available variable:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GROUP[<i>n</i>]</span> - Group capture.</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">RULE_ID</span> - The ID of the rule.</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>Example:</b>\n            <pre>item/${GROUP[2]}</pre>\n          ":43,"Action":44,"Capture value":45,"Capture then mask value":46,"Mask value":47,"Send to inner rule":48,"Edit inner rule <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>":49,"What action the pattern is going to do.":50,"Javascript function":51,"Guide":52,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Arguments</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>text</h3>\n              <p><b>String</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">A string of the entire content of the file.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>thisModel</h3>\n              <p><b>Object</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The rule object that is currently used by the file.</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\"><i>this</i> Keyword</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.</p>\n\n        ":53,"Arguments":54,"The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:":55,"A string of the entire content of the file.":56,"The rule object that is currently used by the file.":57,"<i>this</i> Keyword":58,"<b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.":59,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Expected Return Value</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>undefined</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        ":60,"Expected Return Value":61,"Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:":62,"Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            ":63,"Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            ":64,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Example</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++ is using regexp-match-indices\n  by that all RegExp.exec() method will return their group offset\n  read more about Regular Expression Indices here: https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar result \t\t\t= [];\nvar captureGroup \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (matches=regex.exec(text))) {\n  console.log(matches);\n  if (!matches?.indices?.[captureGroup]) continue;\n  result.push({\n    start\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][0],\n    end\t\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][1]\n  })\n}\nreturn result;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        ":65,"The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.":66,"Welcome to the Custom Parser Model Creator":67,"Please start by creating a new File Group.":68,"Please define what kind of file you want to parse by clicking\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>Add a new file group</button> button.\n    ":69,"Press F1 to open the help dialog.":70,"New File":71,"Open file":72,"Save file":73,"Save As":74,"Open debugger (F12)":75,"Help":76,"Edit current file pattern":77,"Add a new file pattern":78,"Remove current file pattern":79,"Rule's order does matter, especially when you use masking! Drag to reorder.":80},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.js":{"data":[["Do you want to close Model editor?\rAll unsaved changes will be discarded.","是否要关闭模型编辑器？\r所有未保存的更改将被丢弃。"],["Translate here using ","在该处使用机翻，翻译软件"],["Do you want to discard your changes and open\n","是否要丢弃您的更改并打开\n"],["Error when trying to open file :","尝试打开文件时出错："],["Parser Model Creator","解析器模型创建器"],["Please specify what kind of file you want to parse.\nYou can use semicolon separated glob pattens. For example: *.txt;*.js;*.json","请指定您想要解析的文件类型。\n可以使用分号分隔的通配符模式。例如：*.txt;*.js;*.json"],["Failed to create new file group. Please check your pattern!","创建新文件组失败。请检查您的模式！"],["Do you wish to remove current file group?\nYou can not undo this action!","是否要移除当前文件组？\n此操作无法撤销！"],["Do you want to discard your changes and create a new blank model?","是否要丢弃您的更改并创建一个新的空白模型？"],["Do you want to discard your changes and open a file?","是否要丢弃您的更改并打开一个文件？"],["Clear history","清除历史记录"],["Open latest file","打开最新文件"],["Open from history","从历史记录中打开"],["This feature only available if you are using Developer version of Translator++. You can switch into Developer version by using Basic Utilities -> Change Core NWJS.","此功能仅在您使用 Translator++ 的开发者版本时可用。您可以通过基本工具 -> 更改核心 NWJS 切换到开发者版本。"]],"context":[["tid/156/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5647/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9760/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10037/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10099/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10622/type/StringLiteral","tid/10941/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10665/type/StringLiteral","tid/10987/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11026/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11104/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11174/type/StringLiteral","tid/12080/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11459/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11525/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11607/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11750/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"modelEditor.js","dirname":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor","extension":".js","filename":"modelEditor.js","path":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Do you want to close Model editor?\rAll unsaved changes will be discarded.":0,"Translate here using ":1,"Do you want to discard your changes and open\n":2,"Error when trying to open file :":3,"Parser Model Creator":4,"Please specify what kind of file you want to parse.\nYou can use semicolon separated glob pattens. For example: *.txt;*.js;*.json":5,"Failed to create new file group. Please check your pattern!":6,"Do you wish to remove current file group?\nYou can not undo this action!":7,"Do you want to discard your changes and create a new blank model?":8,"Do you want to discard your changes and open a file?":9,"Clear history":10,"Open latest file":11,"Open from history":12,"This feature only available if you are using Developer version of Translator++. You can switch into Developer version by using Basic Utilities -> Change Core NWJS.":13},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/googleCloudV3/trans.googleCloudV3.js":{"data":[["Invalid language string","无效的语言字符串"],["Required field Project ID is blank!","必填字段项目 ID 为空！"],["Required field Service Account Key is blank!","必填字段服务账户密钥为空！"],["Required field Server Location is blank!","必填字段服务器位置为空！"],["Required field Location of the glossary file is blank!","必填字段术语表文件位置为空！"],["Required field Glossary Languages is blank!","必填字段术语表语言为空！"],["Invalid glossary language value","无效的术语表语言值"],["Currently active glossary on this project: ","当前项目上活动的词汇表："],["Error when retreiving glossary info: ","获取词汇表信息时出错："],["Error when removing glossary : ","移除词汇表时出错："],["Glossary removed successfully.","词汇表已成功移除。"],["Error when creating glossary : ","创建词汇表时出错："],["Glossary created successfully.","词汇表已成功创建。"],["Configuration error:\r\n","配置错误：\r\n"],["No error found!","未发现错误！"],["Node JS is required to use Google Cloud Translate Advanced. Please download and install it from https://node.js","使用Google Cloud Translate Advanced需要Node JS。请从https://node.js下载并安装。"]],"context":[["tid/2012/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3382/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3437/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3499/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3554/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3609/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3640/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3738/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3819/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3903/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3932/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4007/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4036/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4510/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4546/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6155/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"trans.googleCloudV3.js","dirname":"/addons/googleCloudV3","extension":".js","filename":"trans.googleCloudV3.js","path":"/addons/googleCloudV3/trans.googleCloudV3.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Invalid language string":0,"Required field Project ID is blank!":1,"Required field Service Account Key is blank!":2,"Required field Server Location is blank!":3,"Required field Location of the glossary file is blank!":4,"Required field Glossary Languages is blank!":5,"Invalid glossary language value":6,"Currently active glossary on this project: ":7,"Error when retreiving glossary info: ":8,"Error when removing glossary : ":9,"Glossary removed successfully.":10,"Error when creating glossary : ":11,"Glossary created successfully.":12,"Configuration error:\r\n":13,"No error found!":14,"Node JS is required to use Google Cloud Translate Advanced. Please download and install it from https://node.js":15},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/jcap/jcap.js":{"data":[["JCap executable not found at the specified location. Do you want to install JCap?","在指定位置未找到JCap可执行文件。您要安装JCap吗？"],["JCap agent started successfully. Press ","JCap代理已成功启动。按"],["jcapKey","jcapKey"],["Please set the JCap executable path in the addon settings.","请在插件设置中设置JCap可执行文件路径。"],["JCap executable already exists at the specified location.","JCap可执行文件已存在于指定位置。"],["JCap executable downloaded successfully.","JCap可执行文件已成功下载。"],["Failed to download JCap package. Please check the console for details.","下载JCap包失败。请检查控制台以获取详情。"],["JCap executable unpacked successfully.","JCap可执行文件已成功解包。"],["You can now start the JCap agent from the Main Menu - Tools - OCR Tools JCap - Start JCap Agent.","您现在可以从主菜单 - 工具 - OCR工具 JCap - 启动JCap代理。"],["Start JCap OCR Agent","启动JCap OCR代理"],["Failed to unpack JCap package. Please check the console for details.","解包JCap包失败。请检查控制台以获取详情。"],["JCap executable not found at the specified location.","在指定位置未找到JCap可执行文件。"],["Are you sure you want to uninstall JCap? This will delete the JCap executable and its configuration.","确定要卸载JCap吗？这将删除JCap可执行文件及其配置。"],["JCap uninstalled successfully.","JCap卸载成功。"],["Failed to uninstall JCap. Please check the console for details.","卸载JCap失败。请查看控制台以获取详细信息。"],["Help","帮助"],["JCap OCR is an OCR tool that allows you to capture text from the screen and translate it using JCap. To use it start the JCap by clicking the OCR button on main menu.\nThen press the configured key (default: F9) to capture text.","JCap OCR是一款OCR工具，允许您从屏幕捕获文本并使用JCap进行翻译。要使用它，请点击主菜单上的OCR按钮启动JCap。\n然后按下配置的按键（默认：F9）以捕获文本。"]],"context":[["tid/736/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/854/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/862/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1005/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1038/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1392/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1442/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1554/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1566/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1591/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1647/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1755/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1828/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1861/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2350/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2371/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"jcap.js","dirname":"/addons/jcap","extension":".js","filename":"jcap.js","path":"/addons/jcap/jcap.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"JCap executable not found at the specified location. Do you want to install JCap?":0,"JCap agent started successfully. Press ":1,"jcapKey":2,"Please set the JCap executable path in the addon settings.":3,"JCap executable already exists at the specified location.":4,"JCap executable downloaded successfully.":5,"Failed to download JCap package. Please check the console for details.":6,"JCap executable unpacked successfully.":7,"You can now start the JCap agent from the Main Menu - Tools - OCR Tools JCap - Start JCap Agent.":8,"Start JCap OCR Agent":9,"Failed to unpack JCap package. Please check the console for details.":10,"JCap executable not found at the specified location.":11,"Are you sure you want to uninstall JCap? This will delete the JCap executable and its configuration.":12,"JCap uninstalled successfully.":13,"Failed to uninstall JCap. Please check the console for details.":14,"Help":15,"JCap OCR is an OCR tool that allows you to capture text from the screen and translate it using JCap. To use it start the JCap by clicking the OCR button on main menu.\nThen press the configured key (default: F9) to capture text.":16},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/jsonParser/json.js":{"data":[["Beautify JSON data","美化JSON数据"],["When checked the generated data will be beautified.","勾选后，生成的数据将被美化。"],["Start a new translation project from any JSON file.","从任何JSON文件开始一个新的翻译项目。"],["Translator++ will translate any translatable texts found in the JSON files.","Translator++将翻译JSON文件中找到的所有可翻译文本。"],["Read the guide on how to start a new JSON translation project here","在此处阅读如何开始新的JSON翻译项目指南"],["Translator++ will scan through this folder for any JSON files.","Translator++将扫描此文件夹以查找任何JSON文件。"],["How do you want to get the data from the JSON object?","您希望如何从JSON对象获取数据？"],["Parser mode","解析器模式"],["<h2>Simple Mode</h2><p>In simple mode, you can translate all strings value recursively inside the JSON object.<br />In simple mode, the original texts is always the value.</p>","<h2>简单模式</h2><p>在简单模式下，您可以递归翻译JSON对象内的所有字符串值。<br />在简单模式下，原始文本始终是值。</p>"],["<h2>Advanced Mode</h2><p>In advanced mode you can query the JSON and handle key-value paired type translation table where the original text is the key.</p>","<h2>高级模式</h2><p>在高级模式下，您可以查询JSON并处理键值对类型的翻译表，其中原始文本是键。</p>"],["<h2>Info</h2><p>You can use the following query field to select a specific part of the JSON object. The result of the query must be an object or an array of texts.</p>","<h2>信息</h2><p>您可以使用以下查询字段选择JSON对象的特定部分。查询结果必须是一个对象或文本数组。</p>"],["<h3>For objects</h3><p>The <b>key will be used as the original text</b> and <b>the value as the default translation</b>.</p>","<h3>对于对象</h3><p><b>键将用作原始文本</b>，<b>值将用作默认翻译</b>。</p>"],["Parser will automatically register if the value is a string, null, or undefined.<br />","如果值是字符串、null或undefined，解析器将自动注册。<br />"],["<h3>For arrays</h3><p>The parser will register all string values in the array as translatable texts.</p>","<h3>对于数组</h3><p>解析器将注册数组中所有字符串值作为可翻译文本。</p>"],["Start project","开始项目"],["`Invalid destination directory:\\n${","`无效的目标目录：\\n${"],["}`","}`"]],"context":[["tid/92/type/StringLiteral","tid/119/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/102/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2826/type/StringLiteral","tid/2879/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2831/type/StringLiteral","tid/2884/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2836/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2998/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3038/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3214/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3293/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3346/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3446/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3451/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3456/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3461/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3615/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4070/type/TemplateHead"],["tid/4072/type/TemplateTail"]],"basename":"json.js","dirname":"/addons/jsonParser","extension":".js","filename":"json.js","path":"/addons/jsonParser/json.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Beautify JSON data":0,"When checked the generated data will be beautified.":1,"Start a new translation project from any JSON file.":2,"Translator++ will translate any translatable texts found in the JSON files.":3,"Read the guide on how to start a new JSON translation project here":4,"Translator++ will scan through this folder for any JSON files.":5,"How do you want to get the data from the JSON object?":6,"Parser mode":7,"<h2>Simple Mode</h2><p>In simple mode, you can translate all strings value recursively inside the JSON object.<br />In simple mode, the original texts is always the value.</p>":8,"<h2>Advanced Mode</h2><p>In advanced mode you can query the JSON and handle key-value paired type translation table where the original text is the key.</p>":9,"<h2>Info</h2><p>You can use the following query field to select a specific part of the JSON object. The result of the query must be an object or an array of texts.</p>":10,"<h3>For objects</h3><p>The <b>key will be used as the original text</b> and <b>the value as the default translation</b>.</p>":11,"Parser will automatically register if the value is a string, null, or undefined.<br />":12,"<h3>For arrays</h3><p>The parser will register all string values in the array as translatable texts.</p>":13,"Start project":14,"`Invalid destination directory:\\n${":15,"}`":16},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/kagParser/TyranoParser.js":{"data":[["label","标签"],["is duplicated in the same scenario file","在同一场景文件中重复"]],"context":[["tid/2372/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2390/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"TyranoParser.js","dirname":"/addons/kagParser","extension":".js","filename":"TyranoParser.js","path":"/addons/kagParser/TyranoParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"label":0,"is duplicated in the same scenario file":1},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/kagParser/kagParser.js":{"data":[["Select directory","选择目录"],["Select a directory to repack","选择一个目录进行重新打包"],["Target xp3","目标 xp3"],["Select filename. Special filename such as <b>patch.xp3</b>, <b>patch2.xp3</b>...etc get priority over data.xp3 when loaded.","选择文件名。特殊文件名如<b>patch.xp3</b>、<b>patch2.xp3</b>...等在加载时优先于data.xp3。"],["Patch to allow folder structure","允许文件夹结构的补丁"],["By default KAG engine do not read files inside a folder within xp3 files. This option will automatically add folder structure definition to Config.tjs. Has no effect if no Config.tjs file is found.","默认情况下，KAG引擎不会读取xp3文件内文件夹中的文件。此选项将自动向Config.tjs添加文件夹结构定义。如果未找到Config.tjs文件，则无效。"],["Repack into xp3","重新打包为xp3"],["Close","关闭"],["Process","开始"],["<b>Order does matter</b> if you unpack multiple files at once! The files will be unpacked in ordered manner. If the files exist it will be overwritten.","如果同时解包多个文件，<b>顺序很重要</b>！文件将按顺序解包。如果文件已存在，将被覆盖。"],["Unpack XP3 files","解包XP3文件"],["Repack a folder to xp3","将文件夹重新打包为xp3"],["Unpack xp3 file","解包xp3文件"],["Before you create a new project, please make sure that :","在创建新项目之前，请确保："],["All .ks & .tjs files are in plain text (uncompiled, unscrambled, and unencrypted)","所有 .ks 和 .tjs 文件均为纯文本（未编译、未加扰且未加密）"],["KAG Games should be playable even without being repacked. So you should check whether your game is playable or not after being extracted.","KAG游戏即使在未重新打包的情况下也应可玩。因此，解压后应检查游戏是否可玩。"],["Some of the actions will modify your game. <b>So make sure to create a backup of your game!</b>","某些操作会修改您的游戏。<b>因此，请确保创建游戏的备份！</b>"],["Select the game executable file. This file is the main game file that will be used to extract the game data.","选择游戏可执行文件。此文件是用于提取游戏数据的主游戏文件。"],["Translator++ can extract XP3 files with AEC addon. <b>But the extractor is not a surefire solution for all kind XP3</b>.","Translator++ 可以通过 AEC 插件提取 XP3 文件。<b>但提取器并非适用于所有类型 XP3 的万全解决方案</b>。"],["Some scenario files are encrypted. Check this option if you wish Translator++ to try to decrypt them.","某些场景文件是加密的。如果您希望 Translator++ 尝试解密它们，请勾选此选项。"],["This may not work on some projects.","这可能不适用于某些项目。"],["List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. You can drag to sort the list.","可能的字符编码列表。<b>顺序很重要！</b>您可以拖动以排序列表。"],["Literal tags are the tags that will be escaped into Translator++ editor.","字面标签是将在 Translator++ 编辑器中转义的标签。"],["<b>ruby l r</b> are mandatory.","<b>ruby l r</b> 是必需的。"],["<b>[r]</b> Tags will be interpolated by Translator++ into a new line. So you don't need to write <b>[r]</b> explicitly.","<b>[r]</b> 标签将由 Translator++ 插入为新行。因此您无需显式写入 <b>[r]</b>。"],["Kirikiri script (.ks) is heavily customizable and allows developers to create their own tags.","Kirikiri 脚本 (.ks) 高度可定制，允许开发者创建自己的标签。"],["Translator++ can handle standard tags such as character names that start with a sharp (#).","Translator++ 可以处理标准标签，例如以井号 (#) 开头的角色名称。"],["However, Translator++ cannot handle custom tags created by developers.","然而，Translator++ 无法处理开发者创建的自定义标签。"],["Therefore, you may need to define the tags and attributes that need to be translated and those that need to be marked as actor names.","因此，您可能需要定义需要翻译的标签和属性，以及需要标记为演员名称的标签和属性。"],["You might need to <input type=\"button\" value=\"extract your xp3 game\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.kagParser.utils.unpackXP3Dialog()\" /> and analyze the ks script inside it before starting the project.","您可能需要 <input type=\"button\" value=\"提取您的 xp3 游戏\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.kagParser.utils.unpackXP3Dialog()\" /> 并在开始项目前分析其中的 ks 脚本。"],["Create Project","创建项目"],["Pack a folder into xp3","将文件夹打包成 xp3"],["Select the target character encoding.<br />Most Japanese KAG games are written with SHIFT-JIS, but KAG actually has support for UTF16LE unicode. Many translators set the character encoding to UTF16LE so that the game is playable non-Japanese windows without locale emulator. And most importantly, can displays characters outside SHIFT-JIS such as \"café\".<br />By default Translator++ will write to its original character encoding.","选择目标字符编码。<br />大多数日语 KAG 游戏使用 SHIFT-JIS 编写，但 KAG 实际上支持 UTF16LE 编码。许多翻译者将字符编码设置为 UTF16LE，以便游戏可在非日语 Windows 上运行而无需区域模拟器。最重要的是，可以显示 SHIFT-JIS 之外的字符，如 \"café\"。<br />默认情况下，Translator++ 将写入其原始字符编码。"],["There are several ways to produce playable localized game for KAG. Please select one that suit your preference.","有几种方法可以为 KAG 生成可玩的本地化游戏。请选择适合您偏好的方式。"]],"context":[["tid/2913/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2918/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2925/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2930/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2937/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2942/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3173/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3274/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3325/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3558/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3684/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3872/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3929/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4297/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4302/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4307/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4312/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4468/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4508/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4549/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4583/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4631/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4640/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4649/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5046/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5053/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5060/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5067/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5078/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5389/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6942/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7218/type/StringLiteral","tid/7397/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7462/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"kagParser.js","dirname":"/addons/kagParser","extension":".js","filename":"kagParser.js","path":"/addons/kagParser/kagParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select directory":0,"Select a directory to repack":1,"Target xp3":2,"Select filename. Special filename such as <b>patch.xp3</b>, <b>patch2.xp3</b>...etc get priority over data.xp3 when loaded.":3,"Patch to allow folder structure":4,"By default KAG engine do not read files inside a folder within xp3 files. This option will automatically add folder structure definition to Config.tjs. Has no effect if no Config.tjs file is found.":5,"Repack into xp3":6,"Close":7,"Process":8,"<b>Order does matter</b> if you unpack multiple files at once! The files will be unpacked in ordered manner. If the files exist it will be overwritten.":9,"Unpack XP3 files":10,"Repack a folder to xp3":11,"Unpack xp3 file":12,"Before you create a new project, please make sure that :":13,"All .ks & .tjs files are in plain text (uncompiled, unscrambled, and unencrypted)":14,"KAG Games should be playable even without being repacked. So you should check whether your game is playable or not after being extracted.":15,"Some of the actions will modify your game. <b>So make sure to create a backup of your game!</b>":16,"Select the game executable file. This file is the main game file that will be used to extract the game data.":17,"Translator++ can extract XP3 files with AEC addon. <b>But the extractor is not a surefire solution for all kind XP3</b>.":18,"Some scenario files are encrypted. Check this option if you wish Translator++ to try to decrypt them.":19,"This may not work on some projects.":20,"List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. You can drag to sort the list.":21,"Literal tags are the tags that will be escaped into Translator++ editor.":22,"<b>ruby l r</b> are mandatory.":23,"<b>[r]</b> Tags will be interpolated by Translator++ into a new line. So you don't need to write <b>[r]</b> explicitly.":24,"Kirikiri script (.ks) is heavily customizable and allows developers to create their own tags.":25,"Translator++ can handle standard tags such as character names that start with a sharp (#).":26,"However, Translator++ cannot handle custom tags created by developers.":27,"Therefore, you may need to define the tags and attributes that need to be translated and those that need to be marked as actor names.":28,"You might need to <input type=\"button\" value=\"extract your xp3 game\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.kagParser.utils.unpackXP3Dialog()\" /> and analyze the ks script inside it before starting the project.":29,"Create Project":30,"Pack a folder into xp3":31,"Select the target character encoding.<br />Most Japanese KAG games are written with SHIFT-JIS, but KAG actually has support for UTF16LE unicode. Many translators set the character encoding to UTF16LE so that the game is playable non-Japanese windows without locale emulator. And most importantly, can displays characters outside SHIFT-JIS such as \"café\".<br />By default Translator++ will write to its original character encoding.":32,"There are several ways to produce playable localized game for KAG. Please select one that suit your preference.":33},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/po/ExportImport.js":{"data":[["Select mode","选择模式"],["Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.","选择您想要如何开始项目。通过选择文件或文件夹。"],["Select Folder","选择文件夹"],["Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.","选择用于处理的文件夹。Translator++ 将从指定文件夹递归检索 PO 文件。"],["Select File","选择文件"],["Select the files you want to process.","选择您要处理的文件。"],["Filters","过滤器"],["Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>","使用通配符模式过滤文件名。默认为<code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>"],["All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","所选文件夹及其子文件夹中的所有.po文件。"],["All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","所选文件夹及其子文件夹中的所有.mo文件。"],["PO Files","PO 文件"],["MO Files","MO 文件"],["You are about to export the translations as MO files.\n","您即将将翻译导出为 MO 文件。\n"],["- MO files are binary files that cannot be edited manually.\n","- MO 文件是二进制文件，无法手动编辑。\n"],["- Only translated entries are stored in MO files.\n","- 只有已翻译的条目会存储在 MO 文件中。\n"],["Are you sure you want to proceed?","您确定要继续吗？"],["PO / MO Files","PO / MO 文件"]],"context":[["tid/1174/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1196/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1223/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1233/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1267/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1277/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1317/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1327/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1335/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1340/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2342/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2509/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2534/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2550/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2558/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2747/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ExportImport.js","dirname":"/addons/po","extension":".js","filename":"ExportImport.js","path":"/addons/po/ExportImport.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select mode":0,"Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.":1,"Select Folder":2,"Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.":3,"Select File":4,"Select the files you want to process.":5,"Filters":6,"Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>":7,"All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":8,"All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":9,"PO Files":10,"MO Files":11,"You are about to export the translations as MO files.\n":12,"- MO files are binary files that cannot be edited manually.\n":13,"- Only translated entries are stored in MO files.\n":14,"Are you sure you want to proceed?":15,"PO / MO Files":16},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/po/PoParser.js":{"data":[[".po and .mo files are standard text-based and binary file formats used together for software localization, particularly in WordPress, to translate themes and plugins. The PO (Portable Object) file is human-readable text containing translations, while the MO (Machine Object) file is a compiled, machine-readable binary file used by software for faster loading.",".po 和 .mo 文件是用于软件本地化的标准文本和二进制文件格式，特别是在 WordPress 中，用于翻译主题和插件。PO（可移植对象）文件是包含翻译的人类可读文本，而 MO（机器对象）文件是编译后的机器可读二进制文件，供软件快速加载使用。"],["Start translation from PO (Portable Object) and MO (Machine Object) translation scripts","从 PO（可移植对象）和 MO（机器对象）翻译脚本开始翻译"],["Create Project","创建项目"],["Select mode","选择模式"],["Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.","选择您想要如何开始项目。通过选择文件或文件夹。"],["Select Folder","选择文件夹"],["Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.","选择用于处理的文件夹。Translator++ 将从指定文件夹递归检索 PO 文件。"],["Select File","选择文件"],["Select the files you want to process.","选择您要处理的文件。"],["Filters","过滤器"],["Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>","使用通配符模式过滤文件名。默认为<code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>"],["All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","所选文件夹及其子文件夹中的所有.po文件。"],["All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","所选文件夹及其子文件夹中的所有.mo文件。"],["ProjectTitle","项目标题"],["Your project title","您的项目标题"]],"context":[["tid/907/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/951/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1028/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1488/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1510/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1537/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1547/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1580/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1590/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1623/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1633/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1641/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1646/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1681/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1691/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"PoParser.js","dirname":"/addons/po","extension":".js","filename":"PoParser.js","path":"/addons/po/PoParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{".po and .mo files are standard text-based and binary file formats used together for software localization, particularly in WordPress, to translate themes and plugins. The PO (Portable Object) file is human-readable text containing translations, while the MO (Machine Object) file is a compiled, machine-readable binary file used by software for faster loading.":0,"Start translation from PO (Portable Object) and MO (Machine Object) translation scripts":1,"Create Project":2,"Select mode":3,"Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.":4,"Select Folder":5,"Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.":6,"Select File":7,"Select the files you want to process.":8,"Filters":9,"Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>":10,"All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":11,"All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":12,"ProjectTitle":13,"Your project title":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/pylivemakerParser/plmUtils.js":{"data":[["Livemaker Game Extractor","Livemaker游戏提取器"],["Half width character patch","半角字符补丁"],["Patch half-width character","修补半角字符"]],"context":[["tid/347/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/809/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate","tid/870/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1061/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"plmUtils.js","dirname":"/addons/pylivemakerParser","extension":".js","filename":"plmUtils.js","path":"/addons/pylivemakerParser/plmUtils.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Livemaker Game Extractor":0,"Half width character patch":1,"Patch half-width character":2},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/pylivemakerParser/pylivemakerparser.js":{"data":[["Livemaker engine has limitations regarding language support. It requires setting the Windows non-unicode system locale to Japanese to run LiveMaker and LiveNovel applications. Additionally, the engine is hardcoded to only use installed Windows system fonts that support Windows Shift-JIS (MS CP932), which means it may not supports other locales or encodings","Livemaker引擎在语言支持方面有限制。它需要将Windows非Unicode系统区域设置为日语才能运行LiveMaker和LiveNovel应用程序。此外，引擎硬编码为仅使用已安装的Windows系统字体，这些字体支持Windows Shift-JIS（MS CP932），这意味着它可能不支持其他区域设置或编码。"],["Next","Next"],["Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker XP, VX or VX Ace?","无法检测到RPG Maker类型！\n您确定游戏是RPG Maker XP、VX或VX Ace吗？"],["Create a new project","创建新项目"],["Invalid destination file:","无效的目标文件："],[" doesn't seems to be a LiveMaker game.","似乎不是LiveMaker游戏。"]],"context":[["tid/5574/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/5684/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6243/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6541/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6626/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6662/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"pylivemakerparser.js","dirname":"/addons/pylivemakerParser","extension":".js","filename":"pylivemakerparser.js","path":"/addons/pylivemakerParser/pylivemakerparser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Livemaker engine has limitations regarding language support. It requires setting the Windows non-unicode system locale to Japanese to run LiveMaker and LiveNovel applications. Additionally, the engine is hardcoded to only use installed Windows system fonts that support Windows Shift-JIS (MS CP932), which means it may not supports other locales or encodings":0,"Next":1,"Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker XP, VX or VX Ace?":2,"Create a new project":3,"Invalid destination file:":4," doesn't seems to be a LiveMaker game.":5},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/renParser/renParser.js":{"data":[["Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.","开发路径未定义。\n您应注入游戏一次以生成开发路径。"],["Decompile all rpyc files","反编译所有rpyc文件"],["Attempt to decompile all rpyc files into .rpy.<br />Translator++ has its own decompiler. But it is reported that sometimes it fails to decompile some of the games created with Renpy 7. You can leave this field unchecked and decompile the game yourself with your own tools before starting a project.","尝试将所有rpyc文件反编译为.rpy。<br />Translator++有自己的反编译器。但据报道，有时无法反编译某些使用Renpy 7创建的游戏。您可以不勾选此字段，并在开始项目前使用自己的工具反编译游戏。"],["Overwrite rpy","覆盖rpy"],["If checked then the decompiler <b>will overwrite the existing uncompiled rpy files</b>.","如果勾选，反编译器<b>将覆盖现有的未编译rpy文件</b>。"],["Exclude command","排除命令"],["This option will allow us to skip some command for being processed and translated","此选项允许我们跳过某些命令的处理和翻译"],["Separate entries with a space","用空格分隔条目"],["For example, if you put <b>old</b> then all lines in rpy that started with <b>old</b> will be ignored","例如，如果输入<b>old</b>，则rpy中所有以<b>old</b>开头的行将被忽略"],["Are you sure want to start a project without decompiling the rpyc files?","您确定要开始一个项目而不反编译rpyc文件吗？"],["The file you're selected is not a Ren'Py game executable file.\nDo you want to continue anyway?","您选择的文件不是Ren'Py游戏可执行文件。\n是否仍要继续？"],["Play last build","播放最新构建"],["Open Ren'Py documentation","打开Ren'Py文档"],["The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.","选项已设置为使用旧版解析器。\n您可以通过选项菜单随时切换回新解析器。"]],"context":[["tid/6255/type/StringLiteral","tid/11918/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10916/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10921/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10926/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10931/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10936/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10941/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10946/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10951/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11291/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11456/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11869/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11970/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12146/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"renParser.js","dirname":"/addons/renParser","extension":".js","filename":"renParser.js","path":"/addons/renParser/renParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.":0,"Decompile all rpyc files":1,"Attempt to decompile all rpyc files into .rpy.<br />Translator++ has its own decompiler. But it is reported that sometimes it fails to decompile some of the games created with Renpy 7. You can leave this field unchecked and decompile the game yourself with your own tools before starting a project.":2,"Overwrite rpy":3,"If checked then the decompiler <b>will overwrite the existing uncompiled rpy files</b>.":4,"Exclude command":5,"This option will allow us to skip some command for being processed and translated":6,"Separate entries with a space":7,"For example, if you put <b>old</b> then all lines in rpy that started with <b>old</b> will be ignored":8,"Are you sure want to start a project without decompiling the rpyc files?":9,"The file you're selected is not a Ren'Py game executable file.\nDo you want to continue anyway?":10,"Play last build":11,"Open Ren'Py documentation":12,"The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.":13},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/resourceParser/ResourceParser.js":{"data":[["Windows binary file translator","Windows二进制文件翻译器"],["Parsing Windows binary file with","正在解析Windows二进制文件，使用"],["Sellect supported files","选择支持的文件"],["Select supported file type to translate.","选择要翻译的支持文件类型。"],["Create a new project","创建新项目"],["Please select a supported file to parse","请选择支持的文件进行解析"],["Please enter your project title!","请输入您的项目标题！"]],"context":[["tid/4109/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4114/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4127/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4132/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4469/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4550/type/StringLiteral","tid/4600/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4661/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ResourceParser.js","dirname":"/addons/resourceParser","extension":".js","filename":"ResourceParser.js","path":"/addons/resourceParser/ResourceParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Windows binary file translator":0,"Parsing Windows binary file with":1,"Sellect supported files":2,"Select supported file type to translate.":3,"Create a new project":4,"Please select a supported file to parse":5,"Please enter your project title!":6},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rm2k2k3/2k.js":{"data":[["Use Native RPG Player","使用原生RPG播放器"],["Use native RPG Player instead of Easy RPG Player","使用原生RPG播放器而非简易RPG播放器"],["Use native RPG Player","使用原生RPG播放器"],["Target folder","目标文件夹"],["Select destination folder.","选择目标文件夹。"],["Install Easy RPG Player","安装 Easy RPG Player"],["Close","关闭"],["Install","安装"],["Process completed!","处理完成！"],["RPG Maker 2000 & 2003 Parser with xmlTrans plugin.","RPG Maker 2000 & 2003 解析器，带 xmlTrans 插件。"],["Play last build","播放最新构建"],["Apply translation then play","应用翻译后播放"],["Setup Easy RPG in the current directory","在当前目录设置Easy RPG"]],"context":[["tid/164/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/174/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/184/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5955/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5960/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6034/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6202/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6393/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7198/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/8288/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8344/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8395/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"2k.js","dirname":"/addons/rm2k2k3","extension":".js","filename":"2k.js","path":"/addons/rm2k2k3/2k.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Use Native RPG Player":0,"Use native RPG Player instead of Easy RPG Player":1,"Use native RPG Player":2,"Target folder":3,"Select destination folder.":4,"Install Easy RPG Player":5,"Close":6,"Install":7,"Process completed!":8,"RPG Maker 2000 & 2003 Parser with xmlTrans plugin.":9,"Play last build":10,"Apply translation then play":11,"Setup Easy RPG in the current directory":12},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rm2k2k3/2knew.js":{"data":[["Start translation from RM2k / RM2k3 engine","从 RM2k / RM2k3 引擎开始翻译"],["Create project","创建项目"],["Please select RPG Maker 2000/2003 game!","请选择 RPG Maker 2000/2003 游戏！"],["Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker 2000 / 2003?","无法检测到 RPG Maker 类型！\n您确定该游戏是 RPG Maker 2000 / 2003 吗？"]],"context":[["tid/3902/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3971/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4041/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4450/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"2knew.js","dirname":"/addons/rm2k2k3","extension":".js","filename":"2knew.js","path":"/addons/rm2k2k3/2knew.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start translation from RM2k / RM2k3 engine":0,"Create project":1,"Please select RPG Maker 2000/2003 game!":2,"Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker 2000 / 2003?":3},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rm2k2k3/utils.js":{"data":[["Target folder","目标文件夹"],["Select destination folder.","选择目标文件夹。"],["Install Easy RPG Player","安装 Easy RPG Player"],["Close","关闭"],["Install","安装"],["How to add a custom font.\n\nThe fonts must be placed in the Font folder of the game directory and must be named Font.ttf or Font2.ttf. Which font file is used depends on the system graphic font setting. Besides ttf, fon and many other fonts are supported (anything supported by FreeType, the best open source library available for font rendering).\n\nSource: https://blog.easyrpg.org/2023/04/easyrpg-player-0-8-paralyze/","如何添加自定义字体。\n\n字体必须放置在游戏目录的 Font 文件夹中，并且必须命名为 Font.ttf 或 Font2.ttf。使用哪个字体文件取决于系统图形字体设置。除了 ttf，还支持 fon 和许多其他字体（任何由 FreeType 支持的字体，这是用于字体渲染的最佳开源库）。\n\n来源：https://blog.easyrpg.org/2023/04/easyrpg-player-0-8-paralyze/"],["Process completed!","处理完成！"],["Play last build","播放最新构建"],["Apply translation then play","应用翻译后播放"],["Setup Easy RPG in the current directory","在当前目录设置Easy RPG"]],"context":[["tid/934/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/939/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1013/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1130/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1181/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1402/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1450/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1743/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1796/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"utils.js","dirname":"/addons/rm2k2k3","extension":".js","filename":"utils.js","path":"/addons/rm2k2k3/utils.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Target folder":0,"Select destination folder.":1,"Install Easy RPG Player":2,"Close":3,"Install":4,"How to add a custom font.\n\nThe fonts must be placed in the Font folder of the game directory and must be named Font.ttf or Font2.ttf. Which font file is used depends on the system graphic font setting. Besides ttf, fon and many other fonts are supported (anything supported by FreeType, the best open source library available for font rendering).\n\nSource: https://blog.easyrpg.org/2023/04/easyrpg-player-0-8-paralyze/":5,"Process completed!":6,"Play last build":7,"Apply translation then play":8,"Setup Easy RPG in the current directory":9},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmmv/rmmv.js":{"data":[["Beautify JSON data","美化JSON数据"],["When checked the generated data will be beautified.","勾选后，生成的数据将被美化。"],["Error loading system.json","无法加载system.json"],["Loading","加载中"],["index.html not found in","index.html未找到于"],["Encrypted game","加密游戏"],["Select the index.html of your encrypted game.","选择您加密游戏的index.html。"],["Target folder","目标文件夹"],["Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.","选择目标文件夹。此过程将替换现有文件。"],["Decrypt Resources","解密资源"],["Close","关闭"],["Process","开始"],["Source path can not empty","文件路径不可为空"],["Destination path can not empty","目标路径不能为空"],["Path is not a file:","路径并没有指向文件:"],["Invalid directory:","路径非法:"],["Extract enigma","提取enigma"],["Select enigma file.","选择enigma文件。"],["Extract Enigma","提取Enigma"],["Selected file is not an Enigma Virtual Box package.","所选文件不是Enigma Virtual Box包。"],["Plugins are already fetched for this project. Want to re-fetch the plugins?","此项目的插件已获取。是否重新获取插件？"],["Translate Javascript File?","翻译Javascript文件？"],["Cancel","取消"],["I know the risk, Proceed!","我知道风险，继续！"],["Game Executable Path","游戏可执行文件路径"],["Path to the game executable file (.exe)","游戏可执行文件（.exe）的路径"],["NWJS Version","NWJS 版本"],["Change into this NWJS version","切换到此 NWJS 版本"],["Use Developer version","使用开发者版本"],["Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.","使用 NWJS 开发者版本。开发者版本提供开发者工具。适合调试和开发。"],["In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.","在开发者版本中，您可以使用 <b>开发者控制台</b>。按 F12 或右键点击应用并选择“检查”即可访问开发者控制台。"],["Use 32-bit version","使用 32 位版本"],["Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).","使用 NWJS 的 32 位版本。32 位版本有助于与旧系统兼容。如果可能，建议取消勾选此选项（只需升级您的机器，伙计）。"],["Some game feature may not work across NWJS version","某些游戏功能可能在不同 NWJS 版本间不兼容"],["Please be aware that some game feature may not work across NWJS version.","请注意，某些游戏功能可能在不同 NWJS 版本间不兼容。"],["Change RPG Maker MV / RPG Maker MZ / NWJS version","更改 RPG Maker MV / RPG Maker MZ / NWJS 版本"],["This operation will change the NW.js version into","此操作将把 NW.js 版本更改为"],["Please close the application first before continuing.\nDo you want to continue?","请先关闭应用程序再继续。\n您要继续吗？"],["The selected file is not a valid NW.js application.","所选文件不是有效的 NW.js 应用程序。"],["Could not find index.html in the game directory.","在游戏目录中未找到 index.html。"],["Debug menu script not found in addon directory.","在插件目录中未找到调试菜单脚本。"],["Debug menu script is already installed in index.html.","调试菜单脚本已安装在 index.html 中。"],["Debug options installed successfully!","调试选项安装成功！"],["The selected game is not running in NW.js Developer Mode (SDK).\n\n","所选游戏未在 NW.js 开发者模式（SDK）中运行。\n\n"],["Developer Mode provides additional debugging features:\n","开发者模式提供额外的调试功能：\n"],["• Developer Console (F12)\n","• 开发者控制台（F12）\n"],["• Inspect Element (Right-click)\n","• 检查元素（右键单击）\n"],["• Network Monitor\n","• 网络监控器\n"],["• Performance Profiler\n\n","• 性能分析器\n\n"],["Do you want to upgrade to NW.js Developer Mode?\n","您想升级到 NW.js 开发者模式吗？\n"],["(Recommended for better debugging experience)","（推荐以获得更好的调试体验）"],["The game will be upgraded to NW.js SDK version","游戏将升级到 NW.js SDK 版本"],["This may take a few minutes. Please wait...","这可能需要几分钟时间，请稍候..."],["NW.js has been upgraded to Developer Mode successfully!","NW.js 已成功升级到开发者模式！"],["Failed to upgrade to Developer Mode:\n","升级到开发者模式失败：\n"],["Error installing debug options: ","安装调试选项时出错："],["Install Debug Options","安装调试选项"],["This will install a debug menu into your RPG Maker MV/MZ game.","这将在您的 RPG Maker MV/MZ 游戏中安装一个调试菜单。"],["Select the game executable file to install debug options.","选择游戏可执行文件以安装调试选项。"],["Compile HTML to Executable","编译 HTML 为可执行文件"],["Change Existing NWJS Version","更改现有 NWJS 版本"],["Install debug options","安装调试选项"],["Find next","查找下一个"],["Open folder","打开文件夹"],["Open with external application","用外部应用打开"],["Raw JSON data. Right click to open menu.","原始 JSON 数据。右键单击以打开菜单。"],["Patch is available for this trans data. This patch will make your trans data compatible with the current version of Translator++.\nDo you want to patch your Trans data?\n(Some feature may not work properly if you don't patch your trans data)","此翻译数据有可用补丁。此补丁将使您的翻译数据与当前版本的 Translator++ 兼容。\n您想修补您的翻译数据吗？\n（如果不修补，某些功能可能无法正常工作）"],["Unable to locate executable to install debug options. Make sure your game is packaged for Windows with NW.js.","无法找到可执行文件以安装调试选项。请确保您的游戏已为 Windows 打包，使用 NW.js。"],["Error while installing debug options: ","安装调试选项时出错："],["Play last build","播放最新构建"],["Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.","开发路径未定义。\n您应注入游戏一次以生成开发路径。"],["Open editor","打开编辑器"],["Load Plugins Into Project","将插件加载到项目中"],["Compile Game","编译游戏"],["The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.","选项已设置为使用旧版解析器。\n您可以通过选项菜单随时切换回新解析器。"],["Unable to find the file related to the data","无法找到数据对应的原文件"],["To fix this correct the <b>Raw material location</b> field at the <a href=\"#\" class=\"openProjectProperties\">Project properties</a>","To fix this correct the <b>Raw material location</b> field at the <a href=\"#\" class=\"openProjectProperties\">Project properties</a>"],["Maximum dialog line","最大对话框行数"],["Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.","对话框中的最大行数。默认为4。"],["Add debug options","添加调试选项"],["Add debug options into the game to help testing.","向游戏中添加调试选项以辅助测试。"],["Enable this option to add debugging tools to the game. These features can help you test your translation.<br/><b>⚠️ Note: This option is only available if your game is packaged with NWJS for Windows.</b>","启用此选项可为游戏添加调试工具。这些功能可帮助您测试翻译。<br/><b>⚠️ 注意：此选项仅在您的游戏使用NWJS for Windows打包时可用。</b>"]],"context":[["tid/125/type/StringLiteral","tid/152/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/135/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/16151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/19426/type/StringLiteral","tid/19469/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20448/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20619/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20624/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20635/type/StringLiteral","tid/21231/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20640/type/StringLiteral","tid/21236/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20713/type/StringLiteral","tid/30541/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20814/type/StringLiteral","tid/21410/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20865/type/StringLiteral","tid/21461/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20925/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20962/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20992/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21023/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21215/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21220/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21309/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21564/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21678/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22062/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22163/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22214/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22424/type/StringLiteral","tid/24166/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22434/type/StringLiteral","tid/24176/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22468/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22478/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22512/type/StringLiteral","tid/22962/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22522/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22533/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22560/type/StringLiteral","tid/22986/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22570/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22605/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/22610/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23014/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23119/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23148/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23298/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23453/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23555/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23696/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23770/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23812/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23820/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23828/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23836/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23844/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23852/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23868/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23922/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23931/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23972/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24005/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24068/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24217/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate","tid/24282/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/24222/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/24227/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/24482/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24546/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24598/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24781/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24891/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24981/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/25166/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/26021/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/29743/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/29779/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30242/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30291/type/StringLiteral","tid/30388/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30339/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30443/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30705/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30891/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/31622/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/31627/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/32659/type/StringLiteral","tid/32882/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/32669/type/StringLiteral","tid/32892/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/32935/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/32945/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/33021/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"rmmv.js","dirname":"/addons/rmmv","extension":".js","filename":"rmmv.js","path":"/addons/rmmv/rmmv.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Beautify JSON data":0,"When checked the generated data will be beautified.":1,"Error loading system.json":2,"Loading":3,"index.html not found in":4,"Encrypted game":5,"Select the index.html of your encrypted game.":6,"Target folder":7,"Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.":8,"Decrypt Resources":9,"Close":10,"Process":11,"Source path can not empty":12,"Destination path can not empty":13,"Path is not a file:":14,"Invalid directory:":15,"Extract enigma":16,"Select enigma file.":17,"Extract Enigma":18,"Selected file is not an Enigma Virtual Box package.":19,"Plugins are already fetched for this project. Want to re-fetch the plugins?":20,"Translate Javascript File?":21,"Cancel":22,"I know the risk, Proceed!":23,"Game Executable Path":24,"Path to the game executable file (.exe)":25,"NWJS Version":26,"Change into this NWJS version":27,"Use Developer version":28,"Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.":29,"In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.":30,"Use 32-bit version":31,"Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).":32,"Some game feature may not work across NWJS version":33,"Please be aware that some game feature may not work across NWJS version.":34,"Change RPG Maker MV / RPG Maker MZ / NWJS version":35,"This operation will change the NW.js version into":36,"Please close the application first before continuing.\nDo you want to continue?":37,"The selected file is not a valid NW.js application.":38,"Could not find index.html in the game directory.":39,"Debug menu script not found in addon directory.":40,"Debug menu script is already installed in index.html.":41,"Debug options installed successfully!":42,"The selected game is not running in NW.js Developer Mode (SDK).\n\n":43,"Developer Mode provides additional debugging features:\n":44,"• Developer Console (F12)\n":45,"• Inspect Element (Right-click)\n":46,"• Network Monitor\n":47,"• Performance Profiler\n\n":48,"Do you want to upgrade to NW.js Developer Mode?\n":49,"(Recommended for better debugging experience)":50,"The game will be upgraded to NW.js SDK version":51,"This may take a few minutes. Please wait...":52,"NW.js has been upgraded to Developer Mode successfully!":53,"Failed to upgrade to Developer Mode:\n":54,"Error installing debug options: ":55,"Install Debug Options":56,"This will install a debug menu into your RPG Maker MV/MZ game.":57,"Select the game executable file to install debug options.":58,"Compile HTML to Executable":59,"Change Existing NWJS Version":60,"Install debug options":61,"Find next":62,"Open folder":63,"Open with external application":64,"Raw JSON data. Right click to open menu.":65,"Patch is available for this trans data. This patch will make your trans data compatible with the current version of Translator++.\nDo you want to patch your Trans data?\n(Some feature may not work properly if you don't patch your trans data)":66,"Unable to locate executable to install debug options. Make sure your game is packaged for Windows with NW.js.":67,"Error while installing debug options: ":68,"Play last build":69,"Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.":70,"Open editor":71,"Load Plugins Into Project":72,"Compile Game":73,"The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.":74,"Unable to find the file related to the data":75,"To fix this correct the <b>Raw material location</b> field at the <a href=\"#\" class=\"openProjectProperties\">Project properties</a>":76,"Maximum dialog line":77,"Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.":78,"Add debug options":79,"Add debug options into the game to help testing.":80,"Enable this option to add debugging tools to the game. These features can help you test your translation.<br/><b>⚠️ Note: This option is only available if your game is packaged with NWJS for Windows.</b>":81},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js":{"data":[["This feature only available if you are using Developer version of NWJS.","此功能仅在您使用NWJS开发者版本时可用。"]],"context":[["tid/19679/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js","dirname":"/addons/rmmv/src","extension":".js","filename":"dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js","path":"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"This feature only available if you are using Developer version of NWJS.":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu.js":{"data":[["This feature only available if you are using developer version of NW.js.","此功能仅在您使用NW.js开发者版本时可用。"]],"context":[["tid/22924/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"dv-debugmenu.js","dirname":"/addons/rmmv/src","extension":".js","filename":"dv-debugmenu.js","path":"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"This feature only available if you are using developer version of NW.js.":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmrgss/RMUtil.js":{"data":[["Use legacy parser","使用旧版解析器"],["Use the old parser prior to (Translator++ ver. 3.8.12). The old parser doesn't support some newly added features.","使用（Translator++ ver. 3.8.12）之前的旧解析器。旧解析器不支持某些新添加的功能。"],["Use old parser","使用旧解析器"],["Event's thread concurrency","事件线程并发数"],["<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />This option determines the maximum number of worker threads that can concurrently parse event data on the Map and CommonEvents. <b>Set to 0 to disable worker thread</b>. <br />This option has the potential to accelerate the parsing process in larger games. However, it is important to note that in smaller games, enabling this option may actually slow down the parsing process due to the higher execution overhead compared to the parsing time for each data.","<b>警告！实验性功能！</b><br />此选项决定在地图和公共事件中可并发解析事件数据的工作线程最大数量。<b>设置为0以禁用工作线程</b>。<br />此功能可能加速大型游戏的解析过程。但请注意，在小型游戏中，启用此选项可能因执行开销高于每个数据的解析时间而减慢解析过程。"],["The minimum number of command in an event that allowed in thread worker","事件中允许在线程工作者中的最小命令数"],["<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />Thread workers incur overhead during execution, which means that processing blank events or events with a low number of commands can actually hinder the overall process. This option enables you to specify the minimum number of commands an event must have in order to be parsed in a worker thread. <br />It is important to note that even blank events contain one command, and it is more efficient to process such events in the main thread rather than in a worker thread. Therefore, it is recommended to set this number to a value <b>greater than 1</b>.<br />Set to 0 to disable splitting task based on commands.","<b>警告！实验性功能！</b><br />线程工作器在执行过程中会产生开销，这意味着处理空白事件或命令数量较少的事件实际上可能会阻碍整体进程。此选项允许您指定事件必须包含的最小命令数，以便在工作线程中解析。<br />需要注意的是，即使是空白事件也包含一个命令，在主线程中处理此类事件比在工作线程中更高效。因此，建议将此数值设置为<b>大于1</b>。<br />设置为0以禁用基于命令的任务拆分。"],["Note that a blank event actually contains one command, and you definitely want to process blank events in the main thread instead of a worker thread. You should set this number to a value greater than 1.","请注意，空白事件实际上包含一个命令，您肯定希望在主线程而非工作线程中处理空白事件。您应将此数值设置为大于1。"],["RPG Maker XP, VX, Ace, MV & MZ Parser V.3","RPG Maker XP、VX、Ace、MV 和 MZ 解析器 V.3"],["Start translation from RPG Maker game using the latest parser.","使用最新解析器开始从RPG Maker游戏翻译。"],["Error!\r\nTranslator++ is unable to detect the type of ","错误!\nTranslator++无法识别"],["You should change the path!\r\nThe Dev directory should not inside the original game's directory, as this will cause problem if you inject the game latter.","您应该更改路径！\r\n开发目录不应位于原始游戏目录内，因为如果之后注入游戏，这会导致问题。"],["The game is packed with Enigma.\r\nDo you want to extract the package?\r\nThis will take minutes, depend on the size of your game.","该游戏通过Enigma加密了.\n是否需要解包游戏?\n这会可能要花费一些时间."],["Unable to extract the Enigma package!","无法提取Enigma包！"],["Copy & extract data into ","在该文件夹下复制并解包游戏"]],"context":[["tid/263/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/273/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/290/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/344/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/354/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/424/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/434/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/438/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21951/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21956/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22453/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22989/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23038/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23126/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23333/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"RMUtil.js","dirname":"/addons/rmrgss","extension":".js","filename":"RMUtil.js","path":"/addons/rmrgss/RMUtil.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Use legacy parser":0,"Use the old parser prior to (Translator++ ver. 3.8.12). The old parser doesn't support some newly added features.":1,"Use old parser":2,"Event's thread concurrency":3,"<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />This option determines the maximum number of worker threads that can concurrently parse event data on the Map and CommonEvents. <b>Set to 0 to disable worker thread</b>. <br />This option has the potential to accelerate the parsing process in larger games. However, it is important to note that in smaller games, enabling this option may actually slow down the parsing process due to the higher execution overhead compared to the parsing time for each data.":4,"The minimum number of command in an event that allowed in thread worker":5,"<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />Thread workers incur overhead during execution, which means that processing blank events or events with a low number of commands can actually hinder the overall process. This option enables you to specify the minimum number of commands an event must have in order to be parsed in a worker thread. <br />It is important to note that even blank events contain one command, and it is more efficient to process such events in the main thread rather than in a worker thread. Therefore, it is recommended to set this number to a value <b>greater than 1</b>.<br />Set to 0 to disable splitting task based on commands.":6,"Note that a blank event actually contains one command, and you definitely want to process blank events in the main thread instead of a worker thread. You should set this number to a value greater than 1.":7,"RPG Maker XP, VX, Ace, MV & MZ Parser V.3":8,"Start translation from RPG Maker game using the latest parser.":9,"Error!\r\nTranslator++ is unable to detect the type of ":10,"You should change the path!\r\nThe Dev directory should not inside the original game's directory, as this will cause problem if you inject the game latter.":11,"The game is packed with Enigma.\r\nDo you want to extract the package?\r\nThis will take minutes, depend on the size of your game.":12,"Unable to extract the Enigma package!":13,"Copy & extract data into ":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmrgss/legacyHandler.js":{"data":[["RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is needed to run this action.\nRPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is licensed under GPL-3 and cannot be distributed along with the program.\nBut Translator++ can set it up on your behalf.\n\nDo you wan't Translator++ to install RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?","运行此操作需要RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway。\nRPGMakertrans CLI Gateway根据GPL-3许可，不能随程序分发。\n但Translator++可以代表您进行设置。\n\n您希望Translator++为您安装RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway吗？"],["RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is need to be updated.\nDo you wan't Translator++ to update the RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?","RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway需要更新。\n您希望Translator++为您更新RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway吗？"],["Maximum dialog line","最大对话框行数"],["Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.","对话框中的最大行数。默认为4。"]],"context":[["tid/569/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/644/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4420/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4430/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"legacyHandler.js","dirname":"/addons/rmrgss","extension":".js","filename":"legacyHandler.js","path":"/addons/rmrgss/legacyHandler.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is needed to run this action.\nRPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is licensed under GPL-3 and cannot be distributed along with the program.\nBut Translator++ can set it up on your behalf.\n\nDo you wan't Translator++ to install RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?":0,"RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is need to be updated.\nDo you wan't Translator++ to update the RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?":1,"Maximum dialog line":2,"Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.":3},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/srpgStudioParser/srpgstudio.js":{"data":[["Start a translation project from SRPG Studio Engine.","从SRPG Studio引擎开始翻译项目。"],["The parser can handle translation from <b>data.dts</b> (srpgs file); the <b>localization.dat</b> file and localization files (.json, .txt, .js) generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool introduced in version 1.253..","解析器可以处理来自<b>data.dts</b>（srpgs文件）的翻译；<b>localization.dat</b>文件以及SRPG Studio本地化工具（自版本1.253引入）生成的本地化文件（.json、.txt、.js）。"],["Create project","创建项目"],["Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!","错误：customField未定义。这不应该发生！"],["Please select the entry point to translate.","请选择翻译的入口点。"],["There are currently two known locations of translatable text within the SRPG Studio game. <br />","目前已知SRPG Studio游戏中有两个可翻译文本的位置。<br />"],["The first is directly written inside the .srpgs file, and the second is in the localization.dat file. This parser can currently can handle both.","第一个直接写在.srpgs文件中，第二个在localization.dat文件中。此解析器目前可以处理两者。"],["<br />In addition to that, you can also translate the localization files generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool. These files are in JSON, TXT, and JS format.","<br />此外，您还可以翻译由SRPG Studio本地化工具生成的本地化文件。这些文件为JSON、TXT和JS格式。"]],"context":[["tid/2574/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2579/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2648/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2745/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3047/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3054/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3061/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"srpgstudio.js","dirname":"/addons/srpgStudioParser","extension":".js","filename":"srpgstudio.js","path":"/addons/srpgStudioParser/srpgstudio.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start a translation project from SRPG Studio Engine.":0,"The parser can handle translation from <b>data.dts</b> (srpgs file); the <b>localization.dat</b> file and localization files (.json, .txt, .js) generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool introduced in version 1.253..":1,"Create project":2,"Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!":3,"Please select the entry point to translate.":4,"There are currently two known locations of translatable text within the SRPG Studio game. <br />":5,"The first is directly written inside the .srpgs file, and the second is in the localization.dat file. This parser can currently can handle both.":6,"<br />In addition to that, you can also translate the localization files generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool. These files are in JSON, TXT, and JS format.":7},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/srpgStudioParserAlt/srpgstudio-alt.js":{"data":[["Parse SRPG Studio archives and translation dump JSON generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.","解析SRPG Studio存档和由SRPG_Unpacker.exe生成的翻译转储JSON。"],["Start translation from SRPG Studio data.dts, project.dat, or translation dump JSON.<br />This is the latest parser—significantly faster and more stable—which will replace the previous version.","从SRPG Studio的data.dts、project.dat或翻译转储JSON开始翻译。<br />这是最新解析器——显著更快且更稳定——将取代先前版本。"],["Create Project","创建项目"],["Source mode","源模式"],["Choose EXE mode to start from the game executable, archive mode for data.dts / project.dat, or dump mode for translation dump JSON.","选择EXE模式以从游戏可执行文件开始，存档模式用于data.dts / project.dat，或转储模式用于翻译转储JSON。"],["Select executable","选择可执行文件"],["Select the game executable. Translator++ will look for data.dts in the same folder.","选择游戏可执行文件。Translator++将在同一文件夹中查找data.dts。"],["Select archive file","选择存档文件"],["Select data.dts directly.","直接选择data.dts。"],["Select dump folder","选择转储文件夹"],["Select the translation dump folder generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.","选择由SRPG_Unpacker.exe生成的翻译转储文件夹。"],["Filters","过滤器"],["Glob pattern used to select JSON files from the dump folder.","用于从转储文件夹中选择JSON文件的全局模式。"],["ProjectTitle","项目标题"],["Your project title","您的项目标题"]],"context":[["tid/4165/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4208/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4279/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4550/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4582/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4608/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4618/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4651/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4661/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4694/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4704/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4737/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4747/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4780/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4790/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"srpgstudio-alt.js","dirname":"/addons/srpgStudioParserAlt","extension":".js","filename":"srpgstudio-alt.js","path":"/addons/srpgStudioParserAlt/srpgstudio-alt.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Parse SRPG Studio archives and translation dump JSON generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.":0,"Start translation from SRPG Studio data.dts, project.dat, or translation dump JSON.<br />This is the latest parser—significantly faster and more stable—which will replace the previous version.":1,"Create Project":2,"Source mode":3,"Choose EXE mode to start from the game executable, archive mode for data.dts / project.dat, or dump mode for translation dump JSON.":4,"Select executable":5,"Select the game executable. Translator++ will look for data.dts in the same folder.":6,"Select archive file":7,"Select data.dts directly.":8,"Select dump folder":9,"Select the translation dump folder generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.":10,"Filters":11,"Glob pattern used to select JSON files from the dump folder.":12,"ProjectTitle":13,"Your project title":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.html":{"data":[["Sugoi translator location <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Point to the .bat file or .exe file on the root directory of the application.\"></i>","Sugoi翻译器位置 <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"指向应用程序根目录中的.bat文件或.exe文件。\"></i>"],["<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> Invalid path.<br>Some features will be disabled until this is fixed.","<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> 无效路径.<br>某些功能将在这个问题修复之后才能实现."],["Server Type :","服务器类型："],["Installed Model :","已安装模型："],["Install Sugoi Translator","安装Sugoi翻译器"],["Don't have Sugoi Translator?\n            Install customized &amp; optimized Sugoi Translator server now!\n        ","没有Sugoi翻译器？\n            立即安装定制化和优化的Sugoi翻译器服务器！\n        "],["Number of server to start (CPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously\"></i>","要启动的服务器数量（CPU） <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"同时启动的服务器数量\"></i>"],["Number of server to be started simultaneously.<br>More process desn't always means more speed, be mindful of your RAM &amp; CPU capacity.<br>You may won't get the benefit if by running just one server the CPU usage has reached 100%","同时启动的服务器数量。<br>更多进程并不总是意味着更快速度，请注意您的RAM和CPU容量。<br>如果仅运行一个服务器CPU使用率已达到100%，您可能不会获得额外收益。"],["\n                    Your Sugoi Translator doesn't support GPU processing.<br>\n                    You need to patch your server to support GPU processing.<br>\n                    <h3 data-tran=\"\">Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system</h3>\n                    <div>\n                        <span data-tran=\"\">Your GPU is:</span>\n                        <ul class=\"gpuList\"></ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gpuPatchOptions\">\n                        <button class=\"patchGPU\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater</button>\n                        <button class=\"patchGPULegacy\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower</button>\n    \n                    </div>\n                ","\n                    您的Sugoi Translator不支持GPU处理。<br>\n                    您需要修补服务器以支持GPU处理。<br>\n                    <h3 data-tran=\"\">选择以下选项为您的系统安装合适的补丁</h3>\n                    <div>\n                        <span data-tran=\"\">您的GPU是：</span>\n                        <ul class=\"gpuList\"></ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gpuPatchOptions\">\n                        <button class=\"patchGPU\" data-tran=\"\">为NVIDIA 30xx系列或更高版本安装补丁</button>\n                        <button class=\"patchGPULegacy\" data-tran=\"\">为NVIDIA 20xx系列或更低版本安装补丁</button>\n    \n                    </div>\n                "],["Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system","选择以下选项为您的系统安装合适的补丁"],["Your GPU is:","您的GPU是："],["Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater","为NVIDIA 30xx系列或更高版本安装补丁"],["Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower","为NVIDIA 20xx系列或更低版本安装补丁"],["Number of server to start (GPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously using GPU. Your server must be patched to enable GPU processing.\"></i>","要启动的服务器数量（GPU） <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"同时使用GPU启动的服务器数量。您的服务器必须已修补以启用GPU处理。\"></i>"],["How many server do you want to start on your <b>GPU</b>. It is possible to run both CPU and GPU based service simultaneously. But please keep in mind that if your CPU usage is high it may hinder the GPU performance.<br>Your server must be patched to enable this mode.","您希望在<b>GPU</b>上启动多少台服务器。可以同时运行基于CPU和GPU的服务。但请注意，如果CPU使用率高，可能会影响GPU性能。<br>您的服务器必须已修补才能启用此模式。"],["Starting port number","起始端口号"],["The port numbers will be generated incrementaly starting from the value below","端口号将从以下值开始递增生成"],["Keep console window open","保持控制台窗口打开"],["prevent console window from closing when the server closes. This option is useful for checking for errors that caused the server to crash.","防止服务器关闭时控制台窗口关闭。此选项有助于检查导致服务器崩溃的错误。"],["Action","操作"],["Set Sugoi Trans config based on this setting","基于此设置配置Sugoi Trans"],["Start All Server","启动所有服务器"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText","idx/6/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"]],"basename":"serverManager.html","dirname":"/addons/sugoiTrans","extension":".html","filename":"serverManager.html","path":"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Sugoi translator location <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Point to the .bat file or .exe file on the root directory of the application.\"></i>":0,"<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> Invalid path.<br>Some features will be disabled until this is fixed.":1,"Server Type :":2,"Installed Model :":3,"Install Sugoi Translator":4,"Don't have Sugoi Translator?\n            Install customized &amp; optimized Sugoi Translator server now!\n        ":5,"Number of server to start (CPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously\"></i>":6,"Number of server to be started simultaneously.<br>More process desn't always means more speed, be mindful of your RAM &amp; CPU capacity.<br>You may won't get the benefit if by running just one server the CPU usage has reached 100%":7,"\n                    Your Sugoi Translator doesn't support GPU processing.<br>\n                    You need to patch your server to support GPU processing.<br>\n                    <h3 data-tran=\"\">Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system</h3>\n                    <div>\n                        <span data-tran=\"\">Your GPU is:</span>\n                        <ul class=\"gpuList\"></ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gpuPatchOptions\">\n                        <button class=\"patchGPU\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater</button>\n                        <button class=\"patchGPULegacy\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower</button>\n    \n                    </div>\n                ":8,"Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system":9,"Your GPU is:":10,"Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater":11,"Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower":12,"Number of server to start (GPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously using GPU. Your server must be patched to enable GPU processing.\"></i>":13,"How many server do you want to start on your <b>GPU</b>. It is possible to run both CPU and GPU based service simultaneously. But please keep in mind that if your CPU usage is high it may hinder the GPU performance.<br>Your server must be patched to enable this mode.":14,"Starting port number":15,"The port numbers will be generated incrementaly starting from the value below":16,"Keep console window open":17,"prevent console window from closing when the server closes. This option is useful for checking for errors that caused the server to crash.":18,"Action":19,"Set Sugoi Trans config based on this setting":20,"Start All Server":21},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.js":{"data":[["Select installation folder","选择安装文件夹"],["Where do you want to install the CT2 Sugoi Translator into?","您想将CT2 Sugoi Translator安装到哪里？"],["Cancel","取消"],["Install now!","立即安装！"],["Path to the directory can not be empty!","路径不能为空!"],["Invalid directory:","路径非法:"],["Failed to download file. Repository do not exist. Please see the console log for more information.","下载文件失败。存储库不存在。请查看控制台日志以获取更多信息。"],["Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 3XXX series","您确定要更新服务器吗？\n此更新脚本适用于NVIDIA 3XXX系列"],["Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 2XXX series and earlier","您确定要更新服务器吗？\n此更新脚本适用于NVIDIA 2XXX系列及更早版本"],["Install CT2 Sugoi Translator","安装CT2 Sugoi Translator"],["Installation completed\nDo you want to set the Server Manager with this installed server?","安装完成\n是否要使用此已安装的服务器设置服务器管理器？"],["Sugoi Translator Installed","Sugoi翻译器已安装"],["Server started\nPlease wait until the server(s) are ready before you translate things.","服务器已启动\n请等待服务器准备就绪后再进行翻译。"],["This action will overwrite the current value of Sugoi Trans Addon's settings.\nAre you sure?","此操作将覆盖Sugoi翻译器附加设置的当前值。\n确定吗？"],["Do you want to reset the current configuration?","是否要重置当前配置？"],["Configuration refreshed!","配置已刷新！"]],"context":[["tid/528/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate","tid/635/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/533/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/766/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/817/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/900/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/929/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1552/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6226/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6296/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/8731/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8957/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9003/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9606/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9643/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/9713/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9778/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"serverManager.js","dirname":"/addons/sugoiTrans","extension":".js","filename":"serverManager.js","path":"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select installation folder":0,"Where do you want to install the CT2 Sugoi Translator into?":1,"Cancel":2,"Install now!":3,"Path to the directory can not be empty!":4,"Invalid directory:":5,"Failed to download file. Repository do not exist. Please see the console log for more information.":6,"Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 3XXX series":7,"Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 2XXX series and earlier":8,"Install CT2 Sugoi Translator":9,"Installation completed\nDo you want to set the Server Manager with this installed server?":10,"Sugoi Translator Installed":11,"Server started\nPlease wait until the server(s) are ready before you translate things.":12,"This action will overwrite the current value of Sugoi Trans Addon's settings.\nAre you sure?":13,"Do you want to reset the current configuration?":14,"Configuration refreshed!":15},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/sugoiTrans/sugoiTrans.js":{"data":[["Line delimiter","行分隔符"],["Fill in with the characters or phrases that will be escaped by the translator (the original phrase and the translation will always be the same). This will guarantee that the number of lines of the translated text is the same as the number of lines of the original text. \nThere are currently no phrases/characters that Sugoi will escape with a 100% success rate.\nYou can try using &#x3C;br&#x3E; with decent amount of success rate.\nLeave blank if you want to concatenate the lines into a single line.","填写将被翻译器转义的字符或短语（原始短语和翻译将始终保持相同）。这将确保翻译文本的行数与原始文本的行数相同。\n目前没有Sugoi能以100%成功率转义的短语/字符。\n您可以尝试使用&#x3C;br&#x3E;，成功率较高。\n如果要将行合并为单行，请留空。"],["Target URL(s)","目标URL"],["Translator target URL. You can enter one ore more Sugoi Translator back-end URL. Translator++ will load balance the request across all instance of the services. Separate each entry with a new line.","翻译器目标URL。您可以输入一个或多个Sugoi翻译器后端URL。Translator++将在所有服务实例间负载均衡请求。每个条目用新行分隔。"],["Max Parallel job","最大并行任务数"],["Maximum parallel job that run simultaneously.","同时运行的最大并行任务数。"],["Send requests in batch","批量发送请求"],["Send several texts (by Max Parallel job) in array.\nFaster and can cut the execution overhead significantly. You must run the server from server manager to enable this option.","以数组形式发送多个文本（按最大并行任务数）。\n更快，并能显著减少执行开销。必须从服务器管理器运行服务器以启用此选项。"],["Check First Line in Common Reference","检查通用引用中的首行"],["Do not include first line in the payload if the first line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the first line.","如果首行在通用引用中找到，则不包含在有效载荷中。\n这在角色名位于首行时非常有用。"],["Check Last Line in Common Reference","检查通用引用中的末行"],["Do not include last line in the payload if the last line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the last line.","如果末行在通用引用中找到，则不包含在有效载荷中。\n这在角色名位于末行时非常有用。"],["Automatic splitting","自动分割"],["Automatically split the translation into the number of lines matching the original. The length of each line will be of a similar size.","自动将翻译分割成与原始行数匹配的行数。每行长度将相似。"],["Code Escaping Algorithm","代码转义算法"],["Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues (not yet implemented, please wait for the future updates)","对话中内联代码的转义算法（尚未实现，请等待未来更新）"]],"context":[["tid/161/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/171/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/203/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/213/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/257/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/267/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/305/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/315/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/347/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/357/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/389/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/399/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/431/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/441/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/473/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/483/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"sugoiTrans.js","dirname":"/addons/sugoiTrans","extension":".js","filename":"sugoiTrans.js","path":"/addons/sugoiTrans/sugoiTrans.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Line delimiter":0,"Fill in with the characters or phrases that will be escaped by the translator (the original phrase and the translation will always be the same). This will guarantee that the number of lines of the translated text is the same as the number of lines of the original text. \nThere are currently no phrases/characters that Sugoi will escape with a 100% success rate.\nYou can try using &#x3C;br&#x3E; with decent amount of success rate.\nLeave blank if you want to concatenate the lines into a single line.":1,"Target URL(s)":2,"Translator target URL. You can enter one ore more Sugoi Translator back-end URL. Translator++ will load balance the request across all instance of the services. Separate each entry with a new line.":3,"Max Parallel job":4,"Maximum parallel job that run simultaneously.":5,"Send requests in batch":6,"Send several texts (by Max Parallel job) in array.\nFaster and can cut the execution overhead significantly. You must run the server from server manager to enable this option.":7,"Check First Line in Common Reference":8,"Do not include first line in the payload if the first line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the first line.":9,"Check Last Line in Common Reference":10,"Do not include last line in the payload if the last line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the last line.":11,"Automatic splitting":12,"Automatically split the translation into the number of lines matching the original. The length of each line will be of a similar size.":13,"Code Escaping Algorithm":14,"Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues (not yet implemented, please wait for the future updates)":15},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/testAddon/emoji.js":{"data":[["Load Actor Reference as Glossary","加载角色参考作为词汇表"],["If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.","如果勾选，Translator++ 将加载角色参考作为词汇表。这将帮助翻译者理解对话的上下文。角色参考是对话中角色的名称。这将作为词汇表加载给翻译者。这会增加翻译成本。"],["Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.","只有对话中存在的角色才会作为每个批次项目的词汇表加载。使用模板命令在提示消息中加载角色参考。"],["Actor Reference Translation Column","角色参考翻译列"],["The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.","角色名称翻译的列。此列将用作角色参考的翻译。这将提高对话中角色名称翻译的一致性。"],["Actor's Information Column","演员信息列"],["The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.","包含演员附加信息的列。您可以添加更多信息，如性别、年龄等。这将改善对话中代词的翻译。"],["System Message Template","系统消息模板"],["System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.","系统消息是消息的头部，用于告知您的 chatGPT 助手的角色。此消息将作为每个发送给 chatGPT 的批量的第一条消息发送。"],["You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>","您可以使用 JavaScript 模板字面量样式包含以下变量 <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>"],["Variables:<br>","变量：<br>"],["<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>","<li>LANG_FROM : 源语言</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>","<li>LANG_TO : 目标语言</li>"],["<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Full source language name</li>","<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : 完整的源语言名称</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Full target language name</li>","<li>LANG_TO_FULL : 完整的目标语言名称</li>"],["<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>","<li>SOURCE_TEXT : 源文本</li>"],["<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>","<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : 转义算法的预定义消息。</li>"],["<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>","<li>NEWLINE_STRING : 表示换行的字符串（行替代符）。</li>"],["<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>","<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : 批次中的消息数量。</li>"],["<li>ACTOR_INFO : Add information of the actors.</li>","<li>ACTOR_INFO : 添加角色信息。</li>"],["<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>","<li>TITLE : 游戏标题</li>"],["<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>","<li>ENGINE : 游戏引擎</li>"],["<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>","<li>REFERENCE[对象名称] : 从 Translator++ 对象生成参考。<br />示例：<code>REFERENCE[通用参考]</code></li>"],["Body Message Template","正文消息模板"],["Template of the body of your chat.","您聊天正文的模板。"],["Sample conversation","示例对话"],["The ChatGPT Batch API allows you to translate your project asynchronously at 50% lower costs, meaning you will receive the results of your translation <b style=\"color:red\">within 24 hours</b> at <b style=\"color:red\">half the normal cost</b>. This is particularly useful for large projects that do not require immediate translation results.","ChatGPT批量API允许您以50%更低的成本异步翻译项目，这意味着您将在<b style=\"color:red\">24小时内</b>收到翻译结果，且成本仅为<b style=\"color:red\">正常价格的一半</b>。这对于不需要即时翻译结果的大型项目特别有用。"],[" <br />Read more about the ChatGPT Batch API: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch .","<br />了解更多关于ChatGPT批量API的信息：https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch 。"],["Glossary","术语表"],["<h2>Glossary</h2>","<h2>术语表</h2>"],["<p>You may or may not use the glossary. The glossary will be loaded for each batch items to improve the quality of the translation.</p>","<p>您可以选择使用或不使用词汇表。词汇表将为每个批次项目加载，以提高翻译质量。</p>"],["The Column of Actor's Additional Information","演员附加信息列"],["Prompt Template","提示模板"],["<h2>1. System Message</h2>","<h2>1. 系统消息</h2>"],["<p>Here you can explain to the assistant, what is their role.</p>","<p>您可以在此向助手解释其角色。</p>"],["<h2>2. Sample dialogue</h2>","<h2>2. 示例对话</h2>"],["<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>","<p>示例现有对话。您可以编写好或坏回复的示例，以帮助翻译者理解您的目标和对话上下文。</p>"],["<h2>3. Your actual prompt</h2>","<h2>3. 您的实际提示</h2>"],["<p>This is the actual prompt to the assistant.</p>","<p>这是给助手的实际提示。</p>"],["<h3>Overhead cost</h3>\n                        Overhead cost is the cost of the prompt message that you send to the assistant without the actual translation texts. The cost is calculated based on the number of tokens in the prompt message. The more tokens you have, the higher the cost will be.<br>\n                        <b>Current overhead cost:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / request.","<h3>间接成本</h3>\n                        间接成本是指您发送给助手但不包含实际翻译文本的提示消息的成本。该成本基于提示消息中的令牌数量计算。令牌越多，成本越高。<br>\n                        <b>当前间接成本：</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> 令牌 / 请求。"]],"context":[["tid/1555/type/StringLiteral","tid/2095/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1565/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1572/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1606/type/StringLiteral","tid/2126/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1616/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1643/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1653/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1695/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1703/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1711/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1724/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1740/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1748/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1756/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1764/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1772/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1780/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1788/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1796/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1804/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1812/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1850/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1906/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2001/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2013/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2039/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2065/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2072/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2157/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2189/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2215/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2222/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2266/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2273/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2399/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2406/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2459/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"emoji.js","dirname":"/addons/testAddon","extension":".js","filename":"emoji.js","path":"/addons/testAddon/emoji.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Load Actor Reference as Glossary":0,"If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.":1,"Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.":2,"Actor Reference Translation Column":3,"The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.":4,"Actor's Information Column":5,"The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.":6,"System Message Template":7,"System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.":8,"You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>":9,"Variables:<br>":10,"<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>":11,"<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>":12,"<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Full source language name</li>":13,"<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Full target language name</li>":14,"<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>":15,"<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>":16,"<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>":17,"<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>":18,"<li>ACTOR_INFO : Add information of the actors.</li>":19,"<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>":20,"<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>":21,"<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>":22,"Body Message Template":23,"Template of the body of your chat.":24,"Sample conversation":25,"The ChatGPT Batch API allows you to translate your project asynchronously at 50% lower costs, meaning you will receive the results of your translation <b style=\"color:red\">within 24 hours</b> at <b style=\"color:red\">half the normal cost</b>. This is particularly useful for large projects that do not require immediate translation results.":26," <br />Read more about the ChatGPT Batch API: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch .":27,"Glossary":28,"<h2>Glossary</h2>":29,"<p>You may or may not use the glossary. The glossary will be loaded for each batch items to improve the quality of the translation.</p>":30,"The Column of Actor's Additional Information":31,"Prompt Template":32,"<h2>1. System Message</h2>":33,"<p>Here you can explain to the assistant, what is their role.</p>":34,"<h2>2. Sample dialogue</h2>":35,"<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>":36,"<h2>3. Your actual prompt</h2>":37,"<p>This is the actual prompt to the assistant.</p>":38,"<h3>Overhead cost</h3>\n                        Overhead cost is the cost of the prompt message that you send to the assistant without the actual translation texts. The cost is calculated based on the number of tokens in the prompt message. The more tokens you have, the higher the cost will be.<br>\n                        <b>Current overhead cost:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / request.":39},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tinyrpa/util.js":{"data":[["TinyRPA server is not installed. Do you want to install it now?","TinyRPA 服务器未安装。您想现在安装吗？"]],"context":[["tid/854/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"util.js","dirname":"/addons/tinyrpa","extension":".js","filename":"util.js","path":"/addons/tinyrpa/util.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"TinyRPA server is not installed. Do you want to install it now?":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tm/tm.js":{"data":[["Automatic organic translation memorization","自动有机翻译记忆"],["If checked, all organic translation (manually inputted translation) will be memorized automatically.","如果勾选，所有有机翻译（手动输入的翻译）将自动被记忆。"],["Memorize translation by automation script","通过自动化脚本记忆翻译"],["If checked, Translator++ will remember the translation created from automation scripts. \nAll changes via 'this.cells' will be memorized. But it is possible for us to modify the contents of the grid directly using the trans API, such changes will not trigger the automatic memorization.","如果勾选，Translator++ 将记住由自动化脚本创建的翻译。\n所有通过 'this.cells' 进行的更改将被记忆。但我们可以直接使用 trans API 修改网格内容，此类更改不会触发自动记忆。"],["Remind translation on cell translate","在单元格翻译时提醒翻译"],["If checked, Translator++ will load translation from translation memory first before performing automatic translation on selected cell.","如果勾选，Translator++ 将在对选定单元格执行自动翻译前，先从翻译记忆库加载翻译。"],["Default memorization behavior","默认记忆行为"],["Overwrite previous record when performing organic translation. If unchecked, TM will not memorize the new translation for existing record.","执行有机翻译时覆盖先前记录。如果未勾选，翻译记忆库将不会为新翻译记忆现有记录。"],["MySQL host","MySQL 主机"],["The host name or IP address of your MySQL server","您的 MySQL 服务器的主机名或 IP 地址"],["MySQL port","MySQL 端口"],["MySQL Port. Default is 3306.","MySQL 端口。默认为 3306。"],["MySQL user name","MySQL 用户名"],["Username to access the DB.","用于访问数据库的用户名。"],["MySQL password","MySQL 密码"],["Password to access the DB.","用于访问数据库的密码。"],["Database Name","数据库名称"],["Database name. Translator++ will try to create database if not exist. But the success is depend on the privilege of the given credential.","数据库名称。如果数据库不存在，Translator++ 将尝试创建它。但成功与否取决于所提供凭据的权限。"],["Database Type","数据库类型"],["Automatically memorize manually inputted translations?","自动记忆手动输入的翻译吗？"],["Sorry, this addon is only available for active patrons only.\nYou can unlock this feature by becoming a $1 patron.","抱歉，此插件仅对活跃的赞助者开放。\n您可以通过成为每月 $1 的赞助者来解锁此功能。"],["Automatically memorize translation made by automation scripts?","自动记忆由自动化脚本制作的翻译吗？"],["Remind translations when performing translate selection?","执行翻译选择时提醒翻译吗？"],["Use rememorize in organic translation","在有机翻译中使用重新记忆"],["default","默认"],["Indexed DB (experimental)","索引数据库（实验性）"],["MySQL","MySQL"],["Database Setting","数据库设置"],["IndexedDB","IndexedDB"],["Generate","生成"],["Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues","对话内嵌代码的转义算法"],["Test connection","测试连接"],["Connection success!","连接成功！"],["MySql","MySQL"],["Connection failed!\nError:","连接失败！\n错误："],["Install MySQL Server","安装MySQL服务器"],["How to setup MySQL Server","如何设置MySQL服务器"],["Multiple translations for one key sentence is detected.\nOnly the last found translation will be memorized by the Translation Memory.\nDo you want to continue?","检测到一个关键句子有多个翻译。\n只有最后找到的翻译会被翻译记忆库记住。\n您想继续吗？"],["Your database structure need to be updated.","您的数据库结构需要更新。"],["Upgrade database","升级数据库"],["This action will upgrade your database.\nDo you want to upgrade your translation memory database?","此操作将升级您的数据库。\n您想升级您的翻译记忆库数据库吗？"],["The translation memory database has been upgraded!\nPlease restart Translator++!","翻译记忆库数据库已升级！\n请重启 Translator++！"]],"context":[["tid/292/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/302/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/340/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/350/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/388/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/398/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/436/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/446/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/484/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/494/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/532/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/588/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/598/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/643/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/653/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/698/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/708/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/754/type/StringLiteral","tid/764/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/835/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/878/type/StringLiteral","tid/1008/type/StringLiteral","tid/1138/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/965/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1095/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1225/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1290/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1300/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1310/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1390/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1428/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1459/type/StringLiteral","tid/1938/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1469/type/StringLiteral","tid/1948/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1500/type/StringLiteral","tid/1979/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1523/type/StringLiteral","tid/2093/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1557/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2114/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2153/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2201/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3362/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4084/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4095/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4123/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4203/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"tm.js","dirname":"/addons/tm","extension":".js","filename":"tm.js","path":"/addons/tm/tm.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Automatic organic translation memorization":0,"If checked, all organic translation (manually inputted translation) will be memorized automatically.":1,"Memorize translation by automation script":2,"If checked, Translator++ will remember the translation created from automation scripts. \nAll changes via 'this.cells' will be memorized. But it is possible for us to modify the contents of the grid directly using the trans API, such changes will not trigger the automatic memorization.":3,"Remind translation on cell translate":4,"If checked, Translator++ will load translation from translation memory first before performing automatic translation on selected cell.":5,"Default memorization behavior":6,"Overwrite previous record when performing organic translation. If unchecked, TM will not memorize the new translation for existing record.":7,"MySQL host":8,"The host name or IP address of your MySQL server":9,"MySQL port":10,"MySQL Port. Default is 3306.":11,"MySQL user name":12,"Username to access the DB.":13,"MySQL password":14,"Password to access the DB.":15,"Database Name":16,"Database name. Translator++ will try to create database if not exist. But the success is depend on the privilege of the given credential.":17,"Database Type":18,"Automatically memorize manually inputted translations?":19,"Sorry, this addon is only available for active patrons only.\nYou can unlock this feature by becoming a $1 patron.":20,"Automatically memorize translation made by automation scripts?":21,"Remind translations when performing translate selection?":22,"Use rememorize in organic translation":23,"default":24,"Indexed DB (experimental)":25,"MySQL":26,"Database Setting":27,"IndexedDB":28,"Generate":29,"Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues":30,"Test connection":31,"Connection success!":32,"MySql":33,"Connection failed!\nError:":34,"Install MySQL Server":35,"How to setup MySQL Server":36,"Multiple translations for one key sentence is detected.\nOnly the last found translation will be memorized by the Translation Memory.\nDo you want to continue?":37,"Your database structure need to be updated.":38,"Upgrade database":39,"This action will upgrade your database.\nDo you want to upgrade your translation memory database?":40,"The translation memory database has been upgraded!\nPlease restart Translator++!":41},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tm/tmUI.js":{"data":[["Memory","内存"],["Fix the problem!","修复问题！"],["No exact matches found!","未找到完全匹配项！"],["Original","原文"],["Translation","翻译文本"],["Do you want Translator++ to forget the selected cell(s)?","您希望 Translator++ 忘记选中的单元格吗？"],["Auto recall","自动召回"],["Auto memorize organic translation","自动记忆有机翻译"],["Auto memorize automation","自动记忆自动化"],["Use rememorize in organic translation","在有机翻译中使用重新记忆"]],"context":[["tid/47/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/534/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/591/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1126/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1131/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1804/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2391/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2543/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2686/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2838/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"tmUI.js","dirname":"/addons/tm","extension":".js","filename":"tmUI.js","path":"/addons/tm/tmUI.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Memory":0,"Fix the problem!":1,"No exact matches found!":2,"Original":3,"Translation":4,"Do you want Translator++ to forget the selected cell(s)?":5,"Auto recall":6,"Auto memorize organic translation":7,"Auto memorize automation":8,"Use rememorize in organic translation":9},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tpp-localizationTool/fetchtrans.js":{"data":[["Preparing download file...","正在准备下载文件..."],["Translation template downloaded successfully!","翻译模板下载成功！"],["Building translation data...","正在构建翻译数据..."],["Processing: ","处理中："],["Fetching directory content...","正在获取目录内容..."],["Parsing: ","正在解析："],["Localization Tools"],["Generate UI Translation Template"],["Update Translation Table"],["This will overwrite www/lang/template.trans and update all localization files listed in www/lang/options.json.\n\nExisting translations will be preserved. New strings from the current source will be added.\n\nContinue?"],["Saving template.trans..."],["Loading language options..."],["Updating: "],["Failed to update: "],["Translation tables updated successfully!"]],"context":[["tid/2001/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2228/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2286/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2439/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2623/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2825/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3098/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3131/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3208/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3244/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3358/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3402/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3651/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3800/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3840/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"fetchtrans.js","dirname":"/addons/tpp-localizationTool","extension":".js","filename":"fetchtrans.js","path":"/addons/tpp-localizationTool/fetchtrans.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Preparing download file...":0,"Translation template downloaded successfully!":1,"Building translation data...":2,"Processing: ":3,"Fetching directory content...":4,"Parsing: ":5,"Localization Tools":6,"Generate UI Translation Template":7,"Update Translation Table":8,"This will overwrite www/lang/template.trans and update all localization files listed in www/lang/options.json.\n\nExisting translations will be preserved. New strings from the current source will be added.\n\nContinue?":9,"Saving template.trans...":10,"Loading language options...":11,"Updating: ":12,"Failed to update: ":13,"Translation tables updated successfully!":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/transChatGPT/BetterChatGPT/dist/assets/index-05e7d66a.js":{"data":[["customModels.customLabel","customModels.customLabel"],["model","模型"],["|","|"],["promptLibrary","提示库"],["search","搜索"],["downloadChat","下载聊天"],["newChat","新聊天"],["api","API"],["customEndpoint","自定义端点"],["apiEndpoint.inputLabel","apiEndpoint.inputLabel"],["apiKey.inputLabel","apiKey.inputLabel"],["apiVersion.inputLabel","apiVersion.inputLabel"],["apiVersion.description","apiVersion.description"],["securityMessage","securityMessage"],["apiEndpoint.description","apiEndpoint.description"],["apiEndpoint.warn","apiEndpoint.warn"],["partialImportMessages","partialImportMessages"],["import","导入"],["name","名称"],["prompt","提示"],["clearPrompts","清除提示"],["morePrompts","更多提示"],["toast.sync","同步通知"],["toast.stop","停止通知"],["button.sync","同步按钮"],["button.stop","停止按钮"]],"context":[["tid/100988/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/100993/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/461961/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/553437/type/StringLiteral","tid/622216/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/553469/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/557612/type/StringLiteral","tid/557632/type/StringLiteral","tid/557654/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/560505/type/StringLiteral","tid/560543/type/StringLiteral","tid/560586/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606465/type/StringLiteral","tid/606538/type/StringLiteral","tid/606579/type/StringLiteral","tid/606677/type/StringLiteral","tid/606756/type/StringLiteral","tid/606782/type/StringLiteral","tid/606903/type/StringLiteral","tid/606925/type/StringLiteral","tid/606947/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606533/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606574/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606672/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606751/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606777/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606898/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606920/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606942/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/608789/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/608794/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/622327/type/StringLiteral","tid/630226/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/622347/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/622664/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/622687/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/629607/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/629731/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/629